https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/e0c583772c0f1c0cbd41c7c83f87e302b667e737/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:02:51Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:02:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): unblock Vault upgrades without replacing credential storage (#210)\n\n## Production blocker\nArgo fuzekeys-platform targets merged #209 revision\n30c36352779be4b0d8d726fc3e994cda85b11ee9 but is\nOutOfSync/Degraded/Failed. Read-only FuzeInfra run\n[37613761047](https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeInfra/actions/runs/37613761047)\nreports forbidden updates to fuzekeys-vault StatefulSet spec.\n[37613914971](https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeInfra/actions/runs/37613914971)\nverified the installed immutable volumeClaimTemplates metadata: chart\nfuzekeys-0.1.15 / app 0.1.12, local-path, 1Gi, and Vault ready=1.\n\n## Fix\n- Preserve the complete verified installed claim label map in production\nvalues.\n- Use stable identity-only claim labels for NEW installations; support\nexact legacy-label overrides.\n- Keep normal version labels on mutable StatefulSet/pod metadata.\n- Chart 0.1.22, appVersion unchanged 0.1.18 (deployment-only correction\nfor already-built images).\n- Add real Helm rendering regression tests and a narrow read-only CI\nworkflow.\n- No Vault/StatefulSet/PVC deletion/recreation, Force/Replace,\ncredential access or authorization widening.\n\n## Verification\n- 6 focused Helm rendering tests passed with Helm 3.16.4.\n- 356 scripts tests passed; 1 preexisting skip.\n- Helm lint (default and production), Black/isort on new test, git diff\n--check passed.\n- All eight uploaded blobs were fetched back and exactly matched the\nisolated tested checkout. Remote tree\ndb3738d2355b05023c68624aef840d0718f2b26e equals local tree; parent is\ncurrent merged master.\n\nProduction is NOT verified: require ordinary review/checks/merge,\nSynced/Healthy Argo, actual Keys backend image 0.1.18 and GET health\ngoogle-shared-v1 before rerunning Front release and connector smoke\ntests. Existing Harden secret-scan failures and managed\nreviewer-baseline drift remain separate blockers; this PR does not\nbypass them.\n\nAutomated implementation uses Israel''s authorized GitHub identity; no\napproving independent review is claimed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"53e87b6794ea3cfbd050684ff8a1aff0232b7fd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/53e87b6794ea3cfbd050684ff8a1aff0232b7fd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/e0c583772c0f1c0cbd41c7c83f87e302b667e737","verification":{"payload":"tree 53e87b6794ea3cfbd050684ff8a1aff0232b7fd8\nparent 30c36352779be4b0d8d726fc3e994cda85b11ee9\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791399771 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791399771 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): unblock Vault upgrades without replacing credential storage (#210)\n\n## Production blocker\nArgo fuzekeys-platform targets merged #209 revision\n30c36352779be4b0d8d726fc3e994cda85b11ee9 but is\nOutOfSync/Degraded/Failed. Read-only FuzeInfra run\n[37613761047](https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeInfra/actions/runs/37613761047)\nreports forbidden updates to fuzekeys-vault StatefulSet spec.\n[37613914971](https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeInfra/actions/runs/37613914971)\nverified the installed immutable volumeClaimTemplates metadata: chart\nfuzekeys-0.1.15 / app 0.1.12, local-path, 1Gi, and Vault ready=1.\n\n## Fix\n- Preserve the complete verified installed claim label map in production\nvalues.\n- Use stable identity-only claim labels for NEW installations; support\nexact legacy-label overrides.\n- Keep normal version labels on mutable StatefulSet/pod metadata.\n- Chart 0.1.22, appVersion unchanged 0.1.18 (deployment-only correction\nfor already-built images).\n- Add real Helm rendering regression tests and a narrow read-only CI\nworkflow.\n- No Vault/StatefulSet/PVC deletion/recreation, Force/Replace,\ncredential access or authorization widening.\n\n## Verification\n- 6 focused Helm rendering tests passed with Helm 3.16.4.\n- 356 scripts tests passed; 1 preexisting skip.\n- Helm lint (default and production), Black/isort on new test, git diff\n--check passed.\n- All eight uploaded blobs were fetched back and exactly matched the\nisolated tested checkout. Remote tree\ndb3738d2355b05023c68624aef840d0718f2b26e equals local tree; parent is\ncurrent merged master.\n\nProduction is NOT verified: require ordinary review/checks/merge,\nSynced/Healthy Argo, actual Keys backend image 0.1.18 and GET health\ngoogle-shared-v1 before rerunning Front release and connector smoke\ntests. Existing Harden secret-scan failures and managed\nreviewer-baseline drift remain separate blockers; this PR does not\nbypass them.\n\nAutomated implementation uses Israel''s authorized GitHub identity; no\napproving independent review is claimed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxpdbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwRYQAIBEomE6zit5FhNEHobCzdU0\nhXwjR2mZpVEVTnTj0cKhtFOkuR6iFhQIOSfdt0G8FsUTDAPMAw+V1pGDYSXyk10h\nruQReKOIg+H1MmklB6lvFWs3JLC0JtVxao/Ys9KCh4eLFDaP/UyDi8AwW4evx36P\ncB3RMyqwg4agRkm6bOh0ELp+LlhX2PtOfWyt45dlWLY+WJ5dTxd5mT6xM3oNBu