fcb596096d85c355f70348ad8a7ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/b063dd604affcb596096d85c355f70348ad8a7ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/716b4f50a2c5619c754802caa2e67b14b5239837/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:58:13Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:58:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(prod): unblock backend scheduling and app registration (#204)\n\n## Production evidence\n- all backend replicas are Pending because `/app/data` and `/app/logs`\nlocal-path PVs are pinned to retired node\n`fuzeinfra-prod-elastic-v2-9b31f718`, while pods require\n`node-role=workload`\n- the new frontend replica loops with `FATAL: jq is required but not\ninstalled`; `curlimages/curl:8.8.0` does not contain jq\n\n## Fix\n- retain both PVC resources to avoid destructive Argo pruning, but mount\n`emptyDir` for cache/log paths in Contabo production; Postgres and Vault\nremain durable stores\n- use Alpine for the registration init container and install both\ndeclared runtime dependencies (`curl`, `jq`) before executing the script\n\n## Safety\nNo credential/PVC deletion or migration. The inaccessible local-path\nclaims remain intact.","tree":{"sha":"f9a4e789733a551b6c324ba6991df99b0739fa12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/f9a4e789733a551b6c324ba6991df99b0739fa12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/716b4f50a2c5619c754802caa2e67b14b5239837","verification":{"payload":"tree f9a4e789733a551b6c324ba6991df99b0739fa12\nparent d8a9fc180e1230fae87f92fad8e42f2e5ca01d16\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1790492293 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790492293 -0700\n\nfix(prod): unblock backend scheduling and app registration (#204)\n\n## Production evidence\n- all backend replicas are Pending because `/app/data` and `/app/logs`\nlocal-path PVs are pinned to retired node\n`fuzeinfra-prod-elastic-v2-9b31f718`, while pods require\n`node-role=workload`\n- the new frontend replica loops with `FATAL: jq is required but not\ninstalled`; `curlimages/curl:8.8.0` does not contain jq\n\n## Fix\n- retain both PVC resources to avoid destructive Argo pruning, but mount\n`emptyDir` for cache/log paths in Contabo production; Postgres and Vault\nremain durable stores\n- use Alpine for the registration init container and install both\ndeclared runtime dependencies (`curl`, `jq`) before executing the script\n\n## Safety\nNo credential/PVC deletion or migration. The inaccessible local-path\nclaims remain intact.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquL6FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1J4QAA/Wzd3QcqlnSTd0TUoMKJk2\nIgsWNWv+4iDTK3/zMyhCJ34VNMwLECeL8G7ILd9bZmfiHpkPGtYyq/wPzH1kDgd0\nUTwy0itO5XvOhTF9q+laKbLrB/8It9cLuCArI6MaTHmvElCR4V5mVIrvYPVBjMOH\nsOd4TJHb/lh8tm7R//eECTt5JmknHtzEmN9BD1S5A+MgwLfjLTIYUgKd+J9RvLeB\nv5oh6wR