nberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:09:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(a2a-maintain): build the FuzeKeys per-product A2A pod and fix keys-broker card/bundle skill conflation (#189)\n\nFleet-wide A2A verification pass (a2a-maintainer) for FuzeKeys.\n\n- agent-templates/roles/keys-broker/role.json: separate A2A card skill-ids\n  from filesystem bundle skills (the S2 conflation).\n- .claude/skills/credential-broker-mediation/SKILL.md and\n  .claude/skills/fuzekeys-expert/SKILL.md: real bundles behind those names.\n- deploy/helm/fuzekeys/templates/a2a.yaml (new): single-tenant per-product A2A\n  pod (ConfigMap + Deployment + Service) against the shared fuze-a2a image,\n  with fail-closed render guards (pinned non-latest tag, inClusterUrl must be\n  this chart''s own Service, one enabled tenant).\n- deploy/helm/fuzekeys/values.yaml / values-contabo.yaml: the a2a: block plus a\n  sibling a2aDeploy: block for chart mechanics. Chart-level a2a.enabled stays\n  false pending operator preconditions.\n- Image-name fix: ghcr.io/izzywdev/fuzeagent-a2a -> ghcr.io/izzywdev/fuze-a2a\n  in .fuze/manifest.json and docs/a2a-tenant-registration.md.\n- governance/a2a-policy.json: point gate-a2a at this repo''s real SealedSecret\n  directory (deploy/argocd/sealed).\n\nBranch brought up to date with master (strict required-status-checks); no\nconflicts. .fuze/manifest.json a2a block (enabled/servingRoles/entryRole/\nprovidesTo) unchanged by the merge.\n\nKnown advisory red, unrelated to or unresolvable in this PR: gate-a2a C1\n(a2a-provider-anthropic SealedSecret not yet sealed — an operator step, and\nthe reason chart-level a2a.enabled is false), gate-workflow-drift,\ngate-identifier, gate-platform-auth, gate-actionlint (all pre-existing on\nmaster, in files this PR does not touch), and fuze-code-review / mcp-maintain\n(LLM providers out of credit; the jobs abstain).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClau