ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/4001a7a2d40e5c0b6a5a188a6c46dc111bdfbec5","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKDQwMDFhN2EyZDQwZTVjMGI2YTVhMTg4YTZjNDZkYzExMWJkZmJlYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/c620f4a287abb61023b163ad72ed83f5249e5c72","sha":"c620f4a287abb61023b163ad72ed83f5249e5c72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/c620f4a287abb61023b163ad72ed83f5249e5c72"}],"sha":"4001a7a2d40e5c0b6a5a188a6c46dc111bdfbec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/4001a7a2d40e5c0b6a5a188a6c46dc111bdfbec5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/c620f4a287abb61023b163ad72ed83f5249e5c72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:54:07Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:54:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): stop the migrate Job failing every sync on an immutable field (#122)\n\nCloses #110.\n\n`fuzekeys-platform` has been OutOfSync/Degraded since 2026-08-24 with:\n\n    Job.batch \"fuzekeys-migrate\" is invalid: spec.template: ...\n    field is immutable (retried 5 times)\n\nA Job''s `spec.template` is immutable in Kubernetes, and `fuzekeys.labels`\nstamps `helm.sh/chart` and `app.kubernetes.io/version` onto the POD TEMPLATE.\nSo every chart version bump mutates an immutable field and the apply is\nrejected. This is not an unlucky upgrade — it is guaranteed on EVERY release,\nwhich is why the app never recovered on its own.\n\n`Replace=true` makes Argo delete and recreate the Job rather than patch it.\nThat is safe here for the reason the template already documents: `alembic\nupgrade head` is a no-op when the DB is at head.\n\nDeliberately NOT the Helm-hook pattern used by vault-bootstrap-job.yaml in\nthis same chart. Argo maps `helm.sh/hook: pre-upgrade` to PreSync, which runs\nbefore the entire sync — including before the wave -2 ConfigMap and the Secret\nthis Job reads via `envFrom`. The migration would then run against absent or\nstale config. The existing sync-wave ordering (config -2 -> migrate -1 ->\nworkloads 0) is what makes that config available, so it stays.\n\nVerified by rendering: `helm template` emits both `sync-wave: \"-1\"` and\n`sync-options: Replace=true` on the Job. Not yet verified against the live\ncluster — that happens when Argo syncs this.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: fe3aa738-cb24-4315-a29b-29834ddea892\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02257f6cf082ee40a9f6882a614de4809080590d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/02257f6cf082ee40a9f6882a614de4809080590d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/c620f4a287abb61023b163ad72ed83f5249e5c72","verification":{"payload":"tree 02257f6cf082ee40a9f6882a614de4809080590d\nparent 8362dd2ca06f2aea07a8cd788e8b89fcd59a9bfd\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1788188047 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788188047 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): stop the migrate Job failing every sync on an immutable field (#122)\n\nCloses #110.\n\n`fuzekeys-platform` has been OutOfSync/Degraded since 2026-08-24 with:\n\n    Job.batch \"fuzekeys-migrate\" is invalid: spec.template: ...\n    field is immutable (retried 5 times)\n\nA Job''s `spec.template` is immutable in Kubernetes, and `fuzekeys.labels`\nstamps `helm.sh/chart` and `app.kubernetes.io/version` onto the POD TEMPLATE.\nSo every chart version bump mutates an immutable field and the apply is\nrejected. This is not an unlucky upgrade — it is guaranteed on EVERY release,\nwhich is why the app never recovered on its own.\n\n`Replace=true` makes Argo delete and recreate the Job rather than patch it.\nThat is safe here for the reason the template already documents: `alembic\nupgrade head` is a no-op when the DB is at head.\n\nDeliberately NOT the Helm-hook pattern used by vault-bootstrap-job.yaml in\nthis same chart. Argo maps `helm.sh/hook: pre-upgrade` to PreSync, which runs\nbefore the entire sync — including before the wave -2 ConfigMap and the Secret\nthis Job reads via `envFrom`. The migration would then run against absent or\nstale config. The existing sync-wave ordering (config -2 -> migrate -1 ->\nworkloads 0) is what makes that config available, so it stays.\n\nVerified by rendering: `helm template` emits both `sync-wave: \"-1\"` and\n`sync-options: Replace=true` on the Job. Not yet verified against the live\ncluster — that happens when Argo syncs this.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: fe3aa738-cb24-4315-a29b-29834ddea892\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlZWPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2jwQACEhawkXBOy7btB3k/Zfinau\n5WB3YnYU1sXdtJIGeBLTYcs8aBPBeAdg1gAB8y6Vu3QTdVA6lyTvflKPcmAQvGPT\n11eFIbi/I2bVa0+yHe5VkZyySqsnCp6mbTFvItSu1PmUh+PZtYj45XD1eQpgqyqs\n4ufK+RWrlxAFyquINL+aBeSqZ4CF/Bp3cVBxTl338dlyDjOjEOoNtoW8viTRLSOX\nw/Z2nwSnTERIQThhCK6+A37+SrOzTdeH2/OVzlYb0Su9L3WhlB23TTiMfRhBI+Am\nSqLB7COtzHqisNjOU+AsoqePvVhHUDmTPY6QnFtERYAUej624fwo4Om/UrnbnRs1\na+B84zvhIO393Bl6fCLlgMz49GfrtARhixE/jCEgNHufyqAxMJheDEWQPGd+LKM5\nIPPyFGtVYFANY49ix7eolJtGXaTI7XlNw93T9xFubDTFAiENjxEBrZDSe3eaZaCh\ng4QUdZjR6I6sJ7hKzZ1JYQp+d5ukD1Fk5zbj7TNvBrFiDDACV4tlpfepomCFxPkC\n5RxQTWLgs3/EpVVUCamjcAFSD+EJez6d+i/86soBj8A2QTJbWBTgMSAUTjhdwvyh\n+C9pqGiQDM7LHSX/cAr26zqGHrJyhSTOdeKK8Lm7oiXTgAZp/tJ/IBoXV9SROpZ1\nLrIA3gxpEG6u2e2DDV5v\n=t92B\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T14:54:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6