:"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/8362dd2ca06f2aea07a8cd788e8b89fcd59a9bfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T19:35:20Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T19:35:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(a2a): enable A2A serving surface; record maintain workflows honestly (#116)\n\nFlip a2a.enabled false->true (repo-local card-projection preconditions met: keys-broker/role.json has a valid description, providesTo populated, serving role + broker core exist). a2a-maintainer validated card projection green in CI. Drop the stale mcp-maintain.yml stamped ledger entry — the on-disk file is the newer fail-closed generation, ahead of the pinned v1.8.0 baseline, so recording it as repo-own (like a2a-maintain.yml) is the honest state; no workflow content changed.\n\nResidual, documented: A2A serving needs a SECOND gate — the FuzeKeys tenant entry in FuzeAgent''s a2a-shared values-prod.yaml — a cross-repo change not made here.\n\nCo-authored-by: Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"03c0b52f7ec9da0788f0881bddf2346327c347ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/03c0b52f7ec9da0788f0881bddf2346327c347ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/8362dd2ca06f2aea07a8cd788e8b89fcd59a9bfd","verification":{"payload":"tree 03c0b52f7ec9da0788f0881bddf2346327c347ae\nparent 5725727802b7ddc659b8ef7ee6f34612342e35c4\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787772920 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787772920 +0300\n\nchore(a2a): enable A2A serving surface; record maintain workflows honestly (#116)\n\nFlip a2a.enabled false->true (repo-local card-projection preconditions met: keys-broker/role.json has a valid description, providesTo populated, serving role + broker core exist). a2a-maintainer validated card projection green in CI. Drop the stale mcp-maintain.yml stamped ledger entry — the on-disk file is the newer fail-closed generation, ahead of the pinned v1.8.0 baseline, so recording it as repo-own (like a2a-maintain.yml) is the honest state; no workflow content changed.\n\nResidual, documented: A2A serving needs a SECOND gate — the FuzeKeys tenant entry in FuzeAgent''s a2a-shared values-prod.yaml — a cross-repo change not made here.\n\nCo-authored-by: Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjz/4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAps4QAAdGXMN3w3iNRBNDLKZNdlQ8\nDk1gPe/uXOG+EkHWQSYJG3SjIP8qJYtTadOrvrvWzMcJi3GR4H7xz80i8Q2qw7mY\nCyM8GuHKm2/ZGo6KFEs4h3gNW2e+LomsCHQyfmThc+fUDBSY4eZ7ZBmAa7eIcukc\nyQRIq7RZI/esLykigxAj/7YskD0FlK+ulkupUW7T1JX+P2jBhtK5p/A464XXTPqn\n1nnJ4S3wTpr03/5Ra50jTH1soYVVitns97+n4l8LEC+xM8nqDfNDpGuEEmeCwEnj\nKUdeS/lWXJ3hLz23iebBqrBqgg68XpRsC+3R/VGDNLx3Ek2+FU3JiNEZ+xKrZXrt\n7vAX2t620sSHZl+0bIt/JKlTzZiWTeqTjOcUWj/0zDYmWDsyzpTCIWwzXZtbYiX2\nLU5zN1ogGt6wT38UgMAhQX4hvlG8RkBBBe5/fzeY8HTPbe3IF9bGMMnBEeW6QxaN\nleVJ2a4HqKlfqjg5A0agUiH8YZQae04Ae2KbVDTpR84tMj3u3KooVChn0Tud1/i1\nWqRMrhyWRjfKa7mqFtyP6F7zMaMzeoFQEHevZUsJXpG+I9ek1BbXoP5vkzwkMbH7\nZbzsFjh7UAaSlfAgKzx6cHUIiFphRTxpNyFJW3y57QSrYV+AsZ/eB5+YIxIDCdg2\nRbCM7o9gcpblgcw1bHXl\n=D9b7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T19:35:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/or