,"name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(deps): bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 3 to 4 (#98)\n\nbuild-and-push.yml is repo-owned; setup-buildx v4 is input-compatible with the\nbuild-backend/build-frontend/build-pii-tokenizer jobs. The failing mcp-maintain\npreflight is systemic and unrelated (no LLM key secret configured), not required\nfor merge.","tree":{"sha":"497397b844d4275aad8e57eee0a552fc2e7f11a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/497397b844d4275aad8e57eee0a552fc2e7f11a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/fb3ac78606ce1f03c464fe898dfdfaf372b5d832","verification":{"payload":"tree 497397b844d4275aad8e57eee0a552fc2e7f11a1\nparent b67ed2204d647b91fa900ae8e45ef44da0177fff\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1787770764 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787770764 +0300\n\nci(deps): bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 3 to 4 (#98)\n\nbuild-and-push.yml is repo-owned; setup-buildx v4 is input-compatible with the\nbuild-backend/build-frontend/build-pii-tokenizer jobs. The failing mcp-maintain\npreflight is systemic and unrelated (no LLM key secret configured), not required\nfor merge.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjzeMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfpEQAB+fDX/yQu8OhT8nQDK/ILNC\n9ctfTzhiGTR5QvetbIHxAIsaRft2sizvYDjOyAPZjGYTA3E/+n6Fk/SJTvSTtb2N\n0X80j9mNi6yQLI5nj7oeb8tTfoPZsbhczrMeUCzoG/7ARnF9YJX4NUheWZO7xwy9\nbAqJJOcizy7k0g99cT47majVSfiewaZJTaMTWjnFczNlxXPxWRTArxtF1w0tSrld\nrkDRaEBTQvtiqLb+M20WNOJDoIvt9pHZn49/jOBMqzp/sBfQ7tQy6zojHA2zpamC\nsvxhuE3jUu7JkYFg0ycIoGXOpIAOopIyZGRA31J5m6c2POgeBbHlGLLdH1ItXeD8\nniAshrOTh3NQTMOKF27vwChztEvsqIrHt4iTl+7ndknN2cv81Kkcc39bk170Oz7Y\n+1DekdgBJkPuTxmT1WNqMt+NtEkAoD+CY6BxVWHIwxqANITUublXN6Jc/k5UBDZN\n3c9MDTJmDxn9duPSw5PIzaruOZPifoM+N5dV1pk57lphJrCw10TY4b5jU3Qsi/ca\n15xzfPpd5yVSMS4cs5B1p3dR86MjFYfCoBwGIIwDjwQ92+5GGlAavBLNYlURiGYq\nvcR0AHUMh9Dykc/3LZ9IKKQ+YgQ6xJ0TPmr+gMsqfeLUqdTO8p+p8sSg2LxKUFp3\n