ed_signatures rule.\nA major bump that dropped or renamed that input would break the flow at its\nleast visible point: the automated PR would open fine and then be unmergeable.\n\nVerified against action.yml at the v8 tag -- sign-commits still exists, still\ndocumented as \"Sign commits as github-actions[bot]\". Every other input this\nworkflow passes is intact: token, base, branch, commit-message, title, body,\nadd-paths.\n\nv8.0.0''s only documented breaking change is runs.using -> node24, requiring\nActions Runner >= v2.327.1 on self-hosted runners. This job runs on a\nGitHub-hosted runner. The existing \"v7+ supports sign-commits\" comment stays\naccurate as written, so no edit is needed alongside the bump.\n\n.github/workflows/seal-secrets.yml is repo-local, not a FuzeSDLC hub template.","tree":{"sha":"a0a8b8d8c895490b9956cefe529b95c711fb28a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/a0a8b8d8c895490b9956cefe529b95c711fb28a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/2bc8fac4a973991e370dbd42fd93de7901567601","verification":{"payload":"tree a0a8b8d8c895490b9956cefe529b95c711fb28a8\nparent e10fd0ae60d5bd0fae628e960028810e5f1006d5\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1787205265 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787205265 +0300\n\nci(deps): bump peter-evans/create-pull-request from 7 to 8 (#49)\n\nThe thing that needed checking was sign-commits. seal-secrets.yml relies on it\nso the generated commits are GitHub-API-authored and therefore auto-verified,\nwhich is what lets the resulting PR satisfy master''s required_signatures rule.\nA major bump that dropped or renamed that input would break the flow at its\nleast visible point: the automated PR would open fine and then be unmergeable.\n\nVerified against action.yml at the v8 tag -- sign-commits still exists, still\ndocumented as \"Sign commits as github-actions[bot]\". Every other input this\nworkflow passes is intact: token, base, branch, commit-message, title, body,\nadd-paths.\n\nv8.0.0''s only documented breaking change is runs.using -> node24, requiring\nActions Runner >= v2.327.1 on self-hosted runners. This job runs on a\nGitHub-hosted runner. The existing \"v7+ supports sign-commits\" comment stays\naccurate as written, so no edit is needed alongside the bump.\n\n.github/workflows/seal-secrets.yml is repo-local, not a FuzeSDLC hub template.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhpaRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUxsQADC4pXswJ9E2vrZwmLSw8CNZ\nkDFP4eXGpRbyTyWMvZsWJcvqVCbqOQPUOMqtQEaK99CJH3eoLfp9GEb4OZcDQhdu\nBVvWCfPI/BJOnMzV1qeJsVpRc3E96Ax2s/PZcszS3Jj9JoHoFU5EDKIVbK9Hi9/i\n2YT0IN/qnh68D1T5pGm7jNq+fMSw8fxSPk/N9AWrjAsZ4SSuEVnJ6Nfo257CImVK\nqxVZG8RRVMaQer1hhm1+eDP1q7UOXQZ3OD81JimRtxCAGGYnwOlG8VMjccbGYF4l\n3Yfs93B2D0yttK+Kt1j3iDfMxbKqkV1ScvFJ9hn11BfXMWu2tcPYfzV/Tbfzn4fa\nIgeqA0aLFm/sO6iMts4a0bB9rE53K5/DDB+hSMYUWQVOFBTD4q27ICRK+MoJOQOb\nyUmbA7q6iXKRHx9mU4AlmjSYrmSOPklCHXW48fckp9gW50uFCNQZU361oNAMd83G\nW5+y0xpKkrWBK0l08xgFx2RVuB3RZ/fQwlMJE09gVIHgGdltPa1Ds3SQG+UcvgrH\nj7LhgjpRdLmeXL9i3gv57CxAGPqg/9eKztRFrpNypLawormfiM4XITo7/Gzv8sj9\nGul9Qd0YK6AAPTl70ZgTL2FxeYlvRWv/i/ABn7rti+bDxR24cZlzGgPuMaxC4U63\n/k+SjQh/ra7oNuPY8UUU\n=Xt7x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-20T05:54:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api