hropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3","tree":{"sha":"3d6a88eff2602edfd32398038473da5c1e227c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/3d6a88eff2602edfd32398038473da5c1e227c7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/4a6443a6c9e32fd63f445af311459433d918a00c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3d6a88eff2602edfd32398038473da5c1e227c7e\nparent dd9a58f992eed2542744aa0fd3308a7d061c4f0f\nauthor SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1785218864 +0300\ncommitter SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1785218864 +0300\n\nfix(helm): add Host header to k8s liveness/readiness probes\n\nTrustedHostMiddleware rejects probes that use the pod IP as the Host\nheader. Set Host to the backend ingress hostname in the probe so the\nmiddleware accepts them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAggH15zrr03C0uhLXeinc5yB1pD3\neNdMgHLfG5v9/Yt+UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHXod5TQ/WTJH5IqXHCFTEuQ9C5555QbS58x06rJeSV1j2ZXn22s85FuGJuK89qzgp\nYqAdkZu1NLzJGSs2lRtgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/4a6443a6c9e32fd63f445af311459433d918a00c","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKDRhNjQ0M2E2YzllMzJmZDYzZjQ0NWFmMzExNDU5NDMzZDkxOGEwMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/dd9a58f992eed2542744aa0fd3308a7d061c4f0f","sha":"dd9a58f992eed2542744aa0fd3308a7d061c4f0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/dd9a58f992eed2542744aa0fd3308a7d061c4f0f"}],"sha":"4a6443a6c9e32fd63f445af311459433d918a00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/4a6443a6c9e32fd63f445af311459433d918a00c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/