cy change would land automatically and nothing\nrecorded which standard this repo was on.\n\nNow pins the moving major tag `v1` (FuzeSDLC v1.0.0 @ 87f9ad3). Compatible updates still\nreach this repo automatically (FuzeSDLC re-points v1); breaking changes land as v2 and are\nopted into deliberately per repo.\n\nSee FuzeSDLC governance/versioning.md §5.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0144465241275f11df72d753ac3ab55fe269b1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/a0144465241275f11df72d753ac3ab55fe269b1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/bd2272e3d52b9ba0f89717daed5e3ad8845f91dd","verification":{"payload":"tree a0144465241275f11df72d753ac3ab55fe269b1c\nparent 35de580238213c5fd159ccbf2acdbe75bbf32dc7\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1784279596 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784279596 +0300\n\nchore(governance): pin baselineRef to the v1 standard tag (#51)\n\nWas `main` — every merge to FuzeSDLC main propagated here on the next PR with no version\nboundary, so an unreviewed or breaking policy change would land automatically and nothing\nrecorded which standard this repo was on.\n\nNow pins the moving major tag `v1` (FuzeSDLC v1.0.0 @ 87f9ad3). Compatible updates still\nreach this repo automatically (FuzeSDLC re-points v1); breaking changes land as v2 and are\nopted into deliberately per repo.\n\nSee FuzeSDLC governance/versioning.md §5.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWfIsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQbgQAAGInUqKbcgsrPVncBgjx7pE\nOjYVuMRfpkVhfqVxaVm/KT3kIjZRAQ20J+cJALPAzfnj8t