ses:`, which cannot\n  resolve against the private FuzeSDLC and would red the whole run). Skips with a notice\n  until the read-only FUZESDLC_DEPLOY_KEY secret is set — it cannot break CI.\n- publish-expert.yml — publishes THIS repo''s own <repo>-expert to the FuzeSDLC hub as an\n  agent-sync PR on merge to main, so consuming repos stop carrying drifting hand-copies.\n  Skips until FUZESDLC_AGENT_PUSH_TOKEN is set.\n\nBoth are inert until their secrets exist. See FuzeSDLC governance/agent-ownership.md.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9efaed7d5ee333aee1e751150e55716c8145fea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/9efaed7d5ee333aee1e751150e55716c8145fea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/35de580238213c5fd159ccbf2acdbe75bbf32dc7","verification":{"payload":"tree 9efaed7d5ee333aee1e751150e55716c8145fea1\nparent 14e2c3ad97658ce44bf934e5dafed1d8165d1985\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1784276764 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784276764 +0300\n\nchore(governance): onboard governance-sync + publish-expert (#44)\n\nIncremental FuzeSDLC bootstrap (scripts/sdlc-bootstrap.sh). Adds only what was missing:\n\n- governance-sync.yml — every PR reconciles this repo''s managed files (the manifest''s agent\n  subset + the agent-templates framework) against the FuzeSDLC canonical at its baselineRef,\n  so no PR merges against stale policy. SELF-CONTAINED (no cross-repo `uses:`, which cannot\n  resolve against the private FuzeSDLC and would red the whole run). Skips with a notice\n  until the read-only FUZESDLC_DEPLOY_KEY secret is set — it cannot break CI.\n- publish-expert.yml — publishes THIS repo''s own <repo>-expert to the FuzeSDLC hub as an\n  agent-sync PR on merge to main, so consuming repos stop carrying drifting hand-copies.\n  Skips until FUZESDLC_AGENT_PUSH_TOKEN is set.\n\nBoth are inert until their secrets exist. See FuzeSDLC governance/agent-ownership.md.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWeccCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOxkQABV7ZUxWbAwX/upYZoQG0ENn\nz3mVOHtA2oOO4MvIG2L0h8gdw/ypvKRvRII46RSVK5fJv4ssFWWsqk1f63d9cRUr\nW90q7tBvOHNzULwDh2mZssCAxTxu/K7T+U8EVN1djG+4NoifzNiUdl68RIiWrFEe\ntukDD5rIB5lAyEAR157PCpKM05yczYxaQ4H8q8PcX62sC2JWUIIK3RDTDbFjvSfs\nQ1TElM31JYQ/sowJLflSI9uoYXef1p5WlLGsAnaDaihrDpMFS2G0Io5hj4NCz6Ef\nwFiC9r77eqASsoArF86daif8wR1UuegpGmt51Ln9xvbH8ilZnVI7aPvZj9f3fCdU\nO/rik2c47SrnblQJhV7CKwE7n+94Q/qqgmYT5vO3NiIMKxQHW8/1EjX6CiQUArVI\njt5hEIs5hIPPIhiS2odE0cEhjSJB65JL6/3i/+a7x0hCA+WapiCdNjaaToRYbzhS\nDtJgUuv5s73xsPaRuDGBaIbCZ749jZx4zg9c2W81yJerUVKTs1VIQI7y80KjiALY\nYud1KYTf7HhKpDy861DHyUhjZM7QL5HanJvPMWfvNlDUDlASKTnEyfP1lGVBEOwd\nNxXDBrQUwzISEAm30TO3YEXjBAhE2p9nUPwuXns4XxZM2qnAGVaWJaQ9WW7LP3bh\n4cI9IhLR/F7S3cz7wXJR\n=LBzT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T08:26:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.