ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:45:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mfe): board FuzeKeys onto FuzeFront as ''Keys'' module-federation remote\n\n* feat(mfe): board FuzeKeys onto FuzeFront as ''Keys'' module-federation remote\n\n- Add vite.config.ts with @originjs/vite-plugin-federation\n  scope=fuzeKeysApp, exposes ./FuzeKeysApp → ./src/MfeApp\n  base=/apps/fuzekeys/, dev port 3004, outDir=dist-mfe\n- Add MfeApp.tsx: MemoryRouter wrapper (no BrowserRouter conflict with host)\n  renders content area only; FuzeFront host provides chrome/nav\n- Add index.html: Vite entry point (title \"Keys\")\n- Update Dockerfile: dual-stage build (standalone CRA + MFE Vite),\n  MFE assets copied to /usr/share/nginx/html/apps/fuzekeys/\n- Update nginx.conf: /apps/fuzekeys/ location with CORS headers for\n  cross-origin module federation fetch from FuzeFront host\n  (keys.prod.fuzefront.com ingress already in place — no chart changes needed)\n- FuzeFront registration: seed manifest delegated to izzywdev/FuzeFront#207\n  menuLabel=''Keys'', slug=''fuzekeys'', remoteEntry at\n  https://keys.prod.fuzefront.com/apps/fuzekeys/assets/remoteEntry.js\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n\n* fix(ci): quote Python version matrix to prevent YAML float parsing (3.10 → 3.1)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e7e3a3c5ac9a6bbe9ab7df6c2d1e32c6c861fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/9e7e3a3c5ac9a6bbe9ab7df6c2d1e32c6c861fad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/14e2c3ad97658ce44bf934e5dafed1d8165d1985","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e7e3a3c5ac9a6bbe9ab7df6c2d1e32c6c861fad\nparent 77f78ba94e4f4f3da902376d6a181804d5f47b6a\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1783593912 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783593912 +0300\n\nfeat(mfe): board FuzeKeys onto FuzeFront as ''Keys'' module-federation remote\n\n* feat(mfe): board FuzeKeys onto FuzeFront as ''Keys'' module-federation remote\n\n- Add vite.config.ts with @originjs/vite-plugin-federation\n  scope=fuzeKeysApp, exposes ./FuzeKeysApp → ./src/MfeApp\n  base=/apps/fuzekeys/, dev port 3004, outDir=dist-mfe\n- Add MfeApp.tsx: MemoryRouter wrapper (no BrowserRouter conflict with host)\n  renders content area only; FuzeFront host provides chrome/nav\n- Add index.html: Vite entry point (title \"Keys\")\n- Update Dockerfile: dual-stage build (standalone CRA + MFE Vite),\n  MFE assets copied to /usr/share/nginx/html/apps/fuzekeys/\n- Update nginx.conf: /apps/fuzekeys/ location with CORS headers for\n  cross-origin module federation fetch from FuzeFront host\n  (keys.prod.fuzefront.com ingress already in place — no chart changes needed)\n- FuzeFront registration: seed manifest delegated to izzywdev/FuzeFront#207\n  menuLabel=''Keys'', slug=''fuzekeys'', remoteEntry at\n  https://keys.prod.fuzefront.com/apps/fuzekeys/assets/remoteEntry.js\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n\n* fix(ci): quote Python version matrix to prevent YAML float parsing (3.10 → 3.1)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT3u4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfAoQAABp/mY8tAUQ+EenKO3MKtYx\n6Cnrv0Duxvk89adQ3KvUD1fMzTKqBdaUuUXaveZdVh6WQmT323CDDtSfyiKhUtCs\nc191Dm23PEjiJb9ETzbmk7opWILr+HHqDrDoX/wilqlHs5Wwbr4X