56117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea\nauthor SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1783400186 +0300\ncommitter SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1783400186 +0300\n\nfix(frontend): force-add public/ assets to git (gitignore Gatsby pattern)\n\nThe root .gitignore has a bare ''public'' pattern (Gatsby build output) that\naccidentally ignored frontend/public/ (favicon.svg, index.html). react-scripts\nrequires index.html to exist in COPY context — Docker build was failing with\n\"Could not find a required file: index.html\". Force-track the static source\nassets with git add -f.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAggH15zrr03C0uhLXeinc5yB1pD3\neNdMgHLfG5v9/Yt+UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBCS0BDQtO+NcWrOK2f9+O6pVNB2AaoyMrDkm5TnUr3Zq0lfwotdZGL8QwyEoZ+45J\n9w2H/nZRwG9GSdtZUPQwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/a39a267f116ee30b4bcac335dece39b45c454528","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKGEzOWEyNjdmMTE2ZWUzMGI0YmNhYzMzNWRlY2UzOWI0NWM0NTQ1Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea","sha":"756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea"}],"sha":"a39a267f116ee30b4bcac335dece39b45c454528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/a39a267f116ee30b4bcac335dece39b45c454528"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:53:57Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:53:57Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"message":"chore(secrets): delete locally-sealed fuzekeys-secrets to allow workflow re-seal\n\nThe locally-committed SealedSecret used credentials from a cluster snapshot;\nGH secrets now carry post-rotation values (FuzeInfra #136). Delete the file so\nseal-secrets.yml (idempotent: skips existing files) regenerates it from the\ncurrent FUZEKEYS_DB_USER / FUZEKEYS_DB_PASSWORD GH secrets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3","tree":{"sha":"90a24e83a0961fb3f3464f83d8869aea15a3123b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/90a24e83a0961fb3f3464f83d8869aea15a3123b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 90a24e83a0961fb3f3464f83d8869aea15a3123b\nparent f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8\nauthor SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1783400037 +0300\ncommitter SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1783400037 +0300\n\nchore(secrets): delete locally-sealed fuzekeys-secrets to allow workflow re-seal\n\nThe locally-committed SealedSecret used credentials from a cluster snapshot;\nGH secrets now carry post-rotation values (FuzeInfra #136). Delete the file so\nseal-secrets.yml (idempotent: skips existing files) regenerates it from the\ncurrent FUZEKEYS_DB_USER / FUZEKEYS_DB_PASSWORD GH secrets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAggH15zrr03C0uhLXeinc5yB1pD3\neNdMgHLfG5v9/Yt+UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQB0ZSYDSR1AufbToM+0/Wv0VK328HUNAYDydDnyM1MLJ6RMHhCkdxI60HnX/LRmrj2\n4DdeLGZLK1bqjWA7CHSwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKDc1NjExN2I2NGRmMDY3NzBkMzEwMjdkNGJmNjA3Nzc2OGQ5YzI5ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8","sha":"f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8"}],"sha":"756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/756117b64df06770d31027d4bf6077768d9c29ea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:50:51Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:50:51Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"message":"fix(ci): add docker/setup-buildx-action to build-and-push jobs\n\nGHA cache backend (type=gha) requires the buildx driver; the default docker\ndriver does not support cache export. Add setup-buildx-action@v3 before each\nbuild-push step so cache-from/cache-to work correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3","tree":{"sha":"d57c4685de459df59be78963f2e9d1cc2924728a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/d57c4685de459df59be78963f2e9d1cc2924728a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8","verification":{"payload":"tree d57c4685de459df59be78963f2e9d1cc2924728a\nparent 876c03d1cc2df423ef5eed532d17011bc1403d42\nauthor SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1783399851 +0300\ncommitter SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1783399851 +0300\n\nfix(ci): add docker/setup-buildx-action to build-and-push jobs\n\nGHA cache backend (type=gha) requires the buildx driver; the default docker\ndriver does not support cache export. Add setup-buildx-action@v3 before each\nbuild-push step so cache-from/cache-to work correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAggH15zrr03C0uhLXeinc5yB1pD3\neNdMgHLfG5v9/Yt+UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGbumlfI64PU3Vb8ChRX6yx9RipRJsUfhY5pUHThessoJussn7pQ1HD2fGvygCpmKF\nqR9C8RMZSAIdSxPI7bUgo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKGYyYjgzNjBhNGE0Y2Q5ZTU3ZjBiMTUxNWY2MGJiNTFmMmY4OTZjZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/876c03d1cc2df423ef5eed532d17011bc1403d42","sha":"876c03d1cc2df423ef5eed532d17011bc1403d42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/876c03d1cc2df423ef5eed532d17011bc1403d42"}],"sha":"f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/f2b8360a4a4cd9e57f0b1515f60bb51f2f896ce8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/876c03d1cc2df423ef5eed532d17011bc1403d42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:49:09Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:49:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(deploy): commit SealedSecrets + PII token pattern tests (#32)\n\n* feat(deploy): commit SealedSecrets + add PII token pattern tests\n\nSealedSecrets sealed locally against Contabo cluster:\n- deploy/argocd/sealed/fuzekeys-secrets.yaml: DATABASE_URL, DATABASE_URL_ASYNC,\n  REDIS_URL, SECRET_KEY, CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY, MASTER_KEY_SALT\n- deploy/argocd/sealed/ghcr-pull-secret.yaml: GHCR pull creds for fuzekeys ns\n\nBoth are sealed with the live cluster''s public cert — Argo can sync immediately\nonce the fuzekeys namespace is registered (FuzeInfra#139).\n\nAlso adds TestApiTokenPatterns to pii-tokenizer/test_features.py — 21 tests\ncovering all SECRET_PATTERNS not previously tested: Anthropic sk-ant-, OpenAI\nsk-proj-/sk-, AWS AKIA, GitHub ghp_, Slack xox*, JWT eyJ. Dummy values use\npush-protection-safe formats. 49/49 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n\n* fix(ci): add .gitleaks.toml allowlist for SealedSecrets + gitleaks:allow on test Slack token\n\nSealedSecret ciphertext (deploy/argocd/sealed/*.yaml) is high-entropy base64 by design\nand triggers generic-api-key; allowlist the sealed/ directory in .gitleaks.toml.\nSLACK_APP dummy test token matches slack-legacy-workspace-token; annotate with\n# gitleaks:allow since it is a clearly-fake test fixture with no real credentials.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"089a1901988ec9507d443d984e4af75805a6a18c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/089a1901988ec9507d443d984e4af75805a6a18c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/876c03d1cc2df423ef5eed532d17011bc1403d42","verification":{"payload":"tree 089a1901988ec9507d443d984e4af75805a6a18c\nparent 1f12939f996c8a1713c30e468c4e46cc5d88b779\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1783399749 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783399749 +0300\n\nfeat(deploy): commit SealedSecrets + PII token pattern tests (#32)\n\n* feat(deploy): commit SealedSecrets + add PII token pattern tests\n\nSealedSecrets sealed locally against Contabo cluster:\n- deploy/argocd/sealed/fuzekeys-secrets.yaml: DATABASE_URL, DATABASE_URL_ASYNC,\n  REDIS_URL, SECRET_KEY, CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY, MASTER_KEY_SALT\n- deploy/argocd/sealed/ghcr-pull-secret.yaml: GHCR pull creds for fuzekeys ns\n\nBoth are sealed with the live cluster''s public cert — Argo can sync immediately\nonce the fuzekeys namespace is registered (FuzeInfra#139).\n\nAlso adds TestApiTokenPatterns to pii-tokenizer/test_features.py — 21 tests\ncovering all SECRET_PATTERNS not previously tested: Anthropic sk-ant-, OpenAI\nsk-proj-/sk-, AWS AKIA, GitHub ghp_, Slack xox*, JWT eyJ. Dummy values use\npush-protection-safe formats. 49/49 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: be266aef-d8b5-4446-9ba7-3d14905610a3\n\n* fix(ci): add .gitleaks.toml allowlist for SealedSecrets + gitleaks:allow on test Slack token\n\nSealedSecret ciphertext (deploy/argocd/sealed/*.yaml) is high-entropy base64 by