:"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/7a8a86b795bef72c8f2bcb77f1f114f288d19068","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKDdhOGE4NmI3OTViZWY3MmM4ZjJiY2I3N2YxZjExNGYyODhkMTkwNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/fcd5bf5ed321e0c2f6f0265503f2f397da61548d","sha":"fcd5bf5ed321e0c2f6f0265503f2f397da61548d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/fcd5bf5ed321e0c2f6f0265503f2f397da61548d"}],"sha":"7a8a86b795bef72c8f2bcb77f1f114f288d19068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/7a8a86b795bef72c8f2bcb77f1f114f288d19068"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/cf8af904269b475bfd367fd564cc90df13913e8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T07:48:36Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T07:48:36Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"message":"fix(auth): make login work end-to-end (load order, seed hashing, valid email)\n\nThree code fixes behind the \"Not connected to DB\" / failed sign-in:\n- main.py: call load_dotenv() BEFORE importing routers, so backend/.env applies\n  before database.py builds its async engine at import time (otherwise the\n  configured DB/driver is ignored for the default).\n- database.py: seed demo_user with the app''s passlib hashers (hash_password /\n  generate_master_key_hash) instead of sha256 — the auth verifier is passlib, so\n  sha256-seeded creds raised \"hash could not be identified\" (HTTP 500). Also use\n  a valid email domain (the previous reserved-domain email failed EmailStr -> 422).\n- env.example: document the required SECRET_KEY (auth fails closed without it).\n\nVerified: POST /api/v1/auth/login (demo123 / masterkey123) -> HTTP 200 + bearer\ntoken. (DB on :5433 from #23; backend startup from #26.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: e1f46be7-c51a-4d1e-9c4e-9f885635722d","tree":{"sha":"06ba0638edf305a1e1a340b860fd46be9501e9a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/06ba0638edf305a1e1a340b860fd46be9501e9a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/cf8af904269b475bfd367fd564cc90df13913e8a","verification":{"payload":"tree 06ba0638edf305a1e1a340b860fd46be9501e9a7\nparent c76018c45618dada3a9ceac95671c0064fe24261\nauthor SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1782805716 +0300\ncommitter SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1782805716 +0300\n\nfix(auth): make login work end-to-end (load order, seed hashing, valid email)\n\nThree code fixes behind the \"Not connected to DB\" / failed sign-in:\n- main.py: call load_dotenv() BEFORE importing routers, so backend/.env applies\n  before database.py builds its async engine at import time (otherwise the\n  configured DB/driver is ignored for the default).\n- database.py: seed demo_user with the app''s passlib hashers (hash_password /\n  generate_master_key_hash) instead of sha256 — the auth verifier is passlib, so\n  sha256-seeded creds raised \"hash could not be identified\" (HTTP 500). Also use\n  a valid email domain (the previous reserved-domain email failed EmailStr -> 422).\n- env.example: document the required SECRET_KEY (auth fails closed without it).\n\nVerified: POST /api/v1/auth/login (demo123 / masterkey123) -> HTTP 200 + bearer\ntoken. (DB on :5433 from #23; backend startup from #26.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: e1f46be7-c51a-4d1e-9c4e-9f885635722d\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAggH15zrr03C0uhLXeinc5yB1pD3\neNdMgHLfG5v9/Yt+UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQD2mJGjBgD784eQbkBNNYK6WZf0dhNCywTsWHH7FMHpnRDIkHuz4GMIJpfp5PSyVVq\nDWsFF3o3I6wNK64AFnZgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/cf8af904269b475bfd367fd564cc90df13913e8a","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKGNmOGFmOTA0MjY5YjQ3NWJmZDM2N2ZkNTY0Y2M5MGRmMTM5MTNlOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/c76018c45618dada3a9ceac95671c0064fe24261","sha":"c76018c45618dada3a9ceac95671c0064fe24261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/c76018c45618dada3a9ceac95671c0064fe24261"}],"sha":"cf8af904269b475bfd367fd564cc90df13913e8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/cf8af904269b475bfd367fd564cc90df13913e8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/fuzeone-bot","id":297101864,"login":"fuzeone-bot[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOEbVqKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user