"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/c76018c45618dada3a9ceac95671c0064fe24261","node_id":"C_kwDOO0IuAdoAKGM3NjAxOGM0NTYxOGRhZGEzYTljZWFjOTU2NzFjMDA2NGZlMjQyNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/1d24bfae0684abb02ca3799188d920d1636d3936","sha":"1d24bfae0684abb02ca3799188d920d1636d3936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/1d24bfae0684abb02ca3799188d920d1636d3936"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commit/c00fa814319c10982bfa2863446e34deab02a3f4","sha":"c00fa814319c10982bfa2863446e34deab02a3f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/c00fa814319c10982bfa2863446e34deab02a3f4"}],"sha":"c76018c45618dada3a9ceac95671c0064fe24261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/c76018c45618dada3a9ceac95671c0064fe24261"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/commits/c00fa814319c10982bfa2863446e34deab02a3f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T06:53:14Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T06:53:14Z","email":"signmeup@example.com","name":"SignMeUp Developer"},"message":"fix(backend): remove dead cv2/numpy imports that broke app startup\n\ncaptcha_service.py imported cv2 + numpy but used NEITHER anywhere in the\nbackend (no cv2./np./numpy. calls). The local env drifted to numpy 2.4.6 while\nopencv-python 4.8.1.78 was built for numpy 1.x, so `import cv2` crashed with\n\"numpy.core.multiarray failed to import\" — cascading through\ncaptcha_service -> background_service -> routers/background -> app.main and\npreventing the backend from starting (and blocking pytest collection via\nconftest''s `from app.main import app`). Removing the two unused imports fixes\nstartup with zero functional change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: e1f46be7-c51a-4d1e-9c4e-9f885635722d","tree":{"sha":"ae79fc83c200c71d18d41229864b7437deb1fc0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/trees/ae79fc83c200c71d18d41229864b7437deb1fc0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeKeys/git/commits/c00fa814319c10982bfa2863446e34deab02a3f4","verification":{"payload":"tree ae79fc83c200c71d18d41229864b7437deb1fc0a\nparent 1d24bfae0684abb02ca3799188d920d1636d3936\nauthor SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1782802394 +0300\ncommitter SignMeUp Developer <signmeup@example.com> 1782802394 +0300\n\nfix(backend): remove dead cv2/numpy imports that broke app startup\n\ncaptcha_service.py imported cv2 + numpy but used NEITHER anywhere in the\nbackend (no cv2./np./numpy. calls). The local env drifted to numpy 2.4.6 while\nopencv-python 4.8.1.78 was built for numpy 1.x, so `import cv2` crashed with\n\"numpy.core.multiarray failed to import\" — cascading through\ncaptcha_service -> background_service -> routers/background -> app.main and\npreventing the backend from starting (and blocking pytest collection via\nconftest''s `from app.main import app`). Removing the two unused imports fixes\nstartup with zero functional change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: e1f46be7-c51a-4d1e-9c4e-9f885635722d\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAggH15zrr03C0uhLXe