18f514b51fed32b01ac807f73bcb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commits/1468f978e2ea814c8567ec09ce560bc2f9a82f75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-05T04:34:51Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-05T04:34:51Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"Add tests, improve README, and update build scripts\n\nThis commit introduces a significant number of tests for the core and example-plugin modules, aiming to improve code quality and maintainability.\n\nKey changes:\n- Added unit and integration tests for:\n  - `core/PluginService`\n  - `core/PluginUiController`\n  - `core/ExampleTableService` (using H2, though full execution currently blocked)\n  - `example-plugin/SimpleExamplePlugin`\n  - `example-plugin/ExamplePluginApiController`\n- Updated `plugin-api` interfaces (`Plugin`, `UiPlugin`) with new methods and renamed `getName` to `getPluginName` for clarity. Implementations were updated accordingly.\n- Made various adjustments to Gradle build scripts to support testing and fix compilation issues. This included adding dependencies and attempting to configure jOOQ code generation.\n- Updated `README.md` and `README_CN.md` with new \"Testing\" and \"Code Coverage\" sections, providing instructions on how to run tests and generate reports.\n\nKnown Issue:\nFull test execution for the `core` module and generation of complete code coverage reports are currently blocked by an issue resolving the `org.jooq.jooq-codegen` Gradle plugin. The tests and configurations are in place, but this external dependency issue prevents their successful completion.","tree":{"sha":"a6a3ce027a44b606b7b97b6b7294d27c39317fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/trees/a6a3ce027a44b606b7b97b6b7294d27c39317fae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/commits/1468f978e2ea814c8567ec09ce560bc2f9a82f75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_eve