ion)\n    - HealthController\n    - PluginUiController\n    - PluginService\n\nCRITICAL WARNING:\nDue to a persistent issue with the ''gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar'' file being\nunavailable or non-functional, I was unable to execute any of the tests written in this commit. Their correctness is therefore UNVERIFIED.\nThe Gradle build system could not be initialized, preventing test runs and\ncoverage report generation. Further investigation into the Gradle wrapper setup\nis required.","tree":{"sha":"7df4539c39aad0ca5afe122fc58206dfb5ff2262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/trees/7df4539c39aad0ca5afe122fc58206dfb5ff2262"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/commits/5744470e09a552c6f43514cd9c7107c9ae014563","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","use