com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commits/3aec23744205fada00ee55774ca4b7273825a481/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-03T15:43:46Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-03T15:43:46Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Add packaging and initial service scripts\n\nThis commit introduces a distributable packaging solution and initial scripts for running the application as a service.\n\nKey changes:\n\n1.  **Gradle Packaging (`core/build.gradle.kts`):\n    *   Applied the `application` plugin to the `core` module.\n    *   Configured `distZip` and `distTar` tasks to produce a distribution package with the structure: `bin/`, `lib/`, `plugins/`, `ui/`, `config/`.\n    *   `lib/` includes `core.jar` (as a plain JAR), `plugin-api.jar`, and all runtime dependencies.\n    *   `plugins/` includes `example-plugin.jar`.\n    *   `ui/` includes static assets built from the `main-ui` module.\n    *   `config/` includes a sample `application.properties`.\n\n2.  **Startup Scripts (`core/src/main/dist/`):\n    *   Added custom `zabbix-plus-framework.sh` for Linux/macOS and `zabbix-plus-framework.bat` for Windows.\n    *   These scripts set up the classpath and run the main application (`io.zabbixplus.framework.core.CoreApplication`).\n    *   These are included in the `bin/` directory of the distribution.\n\n3.  **Static Asset Serving (`core/config/WebConfig.java`):\n    *   Modified `WebConfig.java` to enable the `core` application to serve static UI assets from the external `ui/` directory when run from the distribution package.\n\n4.  **Service Definition Files (Initial):\n    *   Created `deployment/systemd/zabbix-plus-framework.service` as a sample systemd unit file for Linux.\n    *   Created `deployment/launchd/io.zabbixplus.framework.plist` as a sample launchd property list for macOS.\n\nFurther work will involve providing scripts/instructions for Windows service installation (likely recommending NSSM) and updating the main `README.md` with comprehensive documentation for packaging, deployment, and service setup on all supported operating systems.","tree":{"sha":"4b6cc575de41388e971fbd0eb5387e10f5711dac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/trees/4b6cc575de41388e971fbd0eb5387e10f5711dac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/commits/3aec23744205fada00ee55774ca4b7273825a481","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":