-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commits/f22b2eb4885fe17f6860e394c1e9ed3793e4fa70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-03T15:22:16Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-03T15:22:16Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"I''ve added a comprehensive README.md for the framework.\n\nThis README includes:\n- Introduction and project overview\n- Framework architecture details\n- Descriptions of `core` and `plugin-api` modules\n- A detailed Plugin Development Guide, including backend and frontend (Vue.js \"Option A\") integration\n- `main-ui` integration specifics (`PluginRegistryService`, dynamic rendering)\n- Information about the `example-plugin` as a showcase\n- Conceptual setup and running instructions\n- Notes on future micro-frontend enhancements","tree":{"sha":"9f25660cdc6e3ab04d3fdec8506c26d3f484475e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/trees/9f25660cdc6e3ab04d3fdec8506c26d3f484475e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/commits/f22b2eb4885fe17f6860e394c1e9ed3793e4fa70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commit/f22b2eb4885fe17f6860e394c1e9ed3793e4fa70","node_id":"C_kwDOO1Cc5toAKGYyMmIyZWI0ODg1ZmUxN2Y2ODYwZTM5NGMxZTllZDM3OTNlNGZhNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commit/db3d115cfea1f3eb8acd2ca233845dd2d89b74cc","sha":"db3d115cfea1f3eb8acd2ca233845dd2d89b74cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commits/db3d115cfea1f3eb8acd2ca233845dd2d89b74cc"}],"sha":"f22b2eb4885fe17f6860e394c1e9ed3793e4fa70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commits/f22b2eb4885fe17f6860e394c1e9ed3793e4fa70"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/commits/db3d115cfea1f3eb8acd2ca233845dd2d89b74cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-03T14:17:00Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-03T14:17:00Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Enhance plugin framework capabilities\n\nThis commit introduces several improvements to the plugin framework:\n\n1.  **Plugin-Specific Configuration:**\n    *   Plugins can now include a `config.yml` or `config.yaml` file in their JAR.\n    *   `PluginService` loads this configuration using SnakeYAML.\n    *   A new `PluginContext` class provides plugins with their parsed configuration (as a `Map<String, Object>`) and the core `ApplicationContext`.\n    *   The `Plugin` interface has a new `init(PluginContext context)` method, called after `load()`, where plugins receive this context.\n\n2.  **Enhanced UI Plugin Integration:**\n    *   The `UiPlugin` interface now includes a `getUiMetadata()` method, which returns a map of UI-related metadata (e.g., main Vue component name, conceptual bundle URL).\n    *   A new REST controller, `PluginUiController`, exposes a GET endpoint at `/api/ui/plugin-metadata`.\n    *   This endpoint returns a list of objects containing each UI plugin''s name, its metadata from `getUiMetadata()`, and its navigation items from `getNavigationItems()`. This allows the frontend to dynamically configure itself based on loaded plugins.\n\n3.  **Core ApplicationContext Access for Plugins:**\n    *   Plugins can access the core Spring `ApplicationContext` via the `PluginContext` passed to their `init` method.\n\nThese changes make plugins more configurable and provide a robust mechanism for integrating plugin UIs with the main application in a dynamic way. The `example-plugin` has been updated to demonstrate these new features.","tree":{"sha":"e8b2cd89f4d4e9759eed98fa048e9d97c81ccb64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/trees/e8b2cd89f4d4e9759eed98fa048e9d97c81ccb64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raulcsj/zabbix-plus/git/commits/db3d115cfea1f3eb8acd2ca233845dd2d89b74cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g