ss: sync article image fallback handling\n\n* Improve RSS cards with article image extraction and text clamping\n\n* [FIX] Avoid duplicating RSS item titles as descriptions\n\n* Remove redodant description message\n\n* Clean up checkbox attribute rendering in the RSS admin form\n\n* Correct wikiplugin_rss ''since'' version tags for the new image/layout params\n\n* Document the RSS profile installer''s default refresh value\n\n* Revert unrelated tracker and facet filter changes accidentally carried over from another branch\n\n* Revert unrelated tracker and facet filter changes accidentally carried over from another branch\n\n* Fix RSS External Feed admin settings not applying to the {rss} plugin, and lighten the date icon\n\n* Remove user-defined RSS fallback images, use built-in generic fallbacks, fix RSS date icon rendering, avoid missing labels notices, keep Edit action on the edit tab, and restore left alignment in the RSS admin list.\n\n* Add improved RSS feed display options with card/list layouts, optional images, fallback image handling, clickable styled cards, safer XML parsing, and minor RSS admin warning fixes.\n\n* [ENH] Add RSS feed image and layout display options\n\n* Add defensive check before accessing queryResult[0][''trackerId'']\n\n* [FIX] FacetFilter: preserve raw facet option keys to fix selected facet loss\n\n* [FIX] search facets regression: keep raw submitted keys, preserve mapped labels\n\n* [FIX] search facets: preserve raw submitted values while keeping mapped labels\n\n* Fix regression introduced by 65011fee1f by preserving raw facet option keys for submission and using mapped values only for display.\n\n* [FIX] Faceted search: preserve selected facets on results page\n\nSee merge request tikiwiki/tiki!11119","tree":{"sha":"a6505fe6d753f8733eeb9ff65514442a66f12809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/trees/a6505fe6d753f8733eeb9ff65514442a66f12809"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/commits/8