2026-09-23T18:02:50Z","email":"mercihabam@gmail.com","name":"Merci Jacob"},"message":"[ENH] Interactively configure admin username rather than using hard-coded \"admin\"\n---\n* use normalized default_admin everywhere\n\n* fix phpstan\n\n* fix: installer upgrade without asking for new admin credentials\n\n* robust way to get default admin login\n\n* warn about unconfigured admin, and change it via preferences page\n\n* Revert \"provide interactive way to change \"admin\" username when upgrading via console command\"\n\nThis reverts commit 27cfcb9d0b00e86710a4639fbf6d22fb539826f2.\n\n* provide interactive way to change \"admin\" username when upgrading via console command\n\n* fix to change everything related to user''s login in batch\n\n* replace plain ''admin'' user with correct administrator username in applicable SQL queries\n\n* replace plain ''admin'' user with correct administrator username in applicable smarty templates\n\n* fix ci\n\n* replace plain ''admin'' user with correct administrator username in applicable php files. (Remaining: tpl, js, sql)\n\n* [FIX] do not show admin credential form on installer update\n\n* fix: correct password update and its pass_confirm\n\n* add credentials form validation, and db update mechanism\n\n* add admin crendentials form in Tiki installer template steps\n\nSee merge request tikiwiki/tiki!10761","tree":{"sha":"a24bae969f8b8c5151bb6c4cd045dc07b29c59d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/trees/a24bae969f8b8c5151bb6c4cd045dc07b29c59d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/commits/5bcbf5c6cf02f73f78b5648760e41b5154a9ba00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68013195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github