/api.github.com/users/mercihabam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mercihabam","id":68013195,"login":"mercihabam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDEzMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mercihabam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commits/2496b2f15c2bff0f79bd1b124627e3f2a4840330/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:04:19Z","email":"mercihabam@gmail.com","name":"Merci Jacob"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:04:19Z","email":"jmail@nospaces.net","name":"Jonny Bradley"},"message":"[FIX] Make DiceBear avatars optional, improve loading of the lib files, and enhance clarity of tiki-pick_avatar.php page\n---\n* prefs conflicts: only show alerts when there is attempt to activate two conflicting prefs\n\n* fix avatars display: use data URI images to prevent inline SVG ID collisions\n\n* fix test: use node_module packages instead of public generated files\n\n* fix unit tests by pointing dicebear packages to proper paths in vite config and adapting to now lazily loaded collections\n\n* add dicebear collections to vite rollupInput to ensure each one is minified\n\n* only load used DiceBear collections instead of all\n\n* add upload via drag-and-drop\n\n* disable \"upload\" button when no file is selected\n\n* remove unecessary max-height\n\n* move prefs in appropriate section, and add a conflict value between ''user_use_gravatar'' and ''user_dicebear_avatar''\n\n* update help with doc link\n\n* do not show user profile picture and avatar at the same time\n\n* improve pick-avatar page with clear UI\n\n* make dicebear avatar feature optional\n\nSee merge request tikiwiki/tiki!10903","tree":{"sha":"bed723a9e09d2fd3ecfe8e95d29facfe1a2d354d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/trees/bed723a9e09d2fd3ecfe8e95d29facfe1a2d354d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/commits/2496b2f15c2bff0f79bd1b124627e3f2a4840330","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonnybradley","id":103898,"login":"jonnybradley","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzg5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnybradley","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commit/2496b2f15c2bff0f79bd1b124627e3f2a4840330","node_id":"C_kwDOO1SSh9oAKDI0OTZiMmYxNWMyYmZmMGY3OWJkMWIxMjQ2MjdlM2YyYTQ4NDAzMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commit/2f7ecb5375483eac6c70bb1310a6995ed66ca1c9","sha":"2f7ecb5375483eac6c70bb1310a6995ed66ca1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commits/2f7ecb5375483eac6c70bb1310a6995ed66ca1c9"}],"sha":"2496b2f15c2bff0f79bd1b124627e3f2a4840330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commits/2496b2f15c2bff0f79bd1b124627e3f2a4840330"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108806646?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olivier-Kango","id":108806646,"login":"Olivier-Kango","node_id":"U_kgDOBnxB9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olivier-Kango","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commits/2f7ecb5375483eac6c70bb1310a6995ed66ca1c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:46:51Z","email":"olivierkango@gmail.com","name":"Olivier Kango"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:46:51Z","email":"gitlab@luciash.cz","name":"luci"},"message":"[ENH] XMPP: Add support chat flow, guest auth, and ConverseJS 14 integration\n---\n* fix(xmpp): reset guest session when leaving community chat\n\n* fix(xmpp): leave community rooms before resetting guest support session\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Confirm guest support chat termination with translatable dialog and await local cleanup\n\n* fix: add horizontal padding to the Converse login form\n\n* fix: decouple external XMPP prebinding from Tiki token access\n\n* fix: resolve PHPCS issues in XMPP prebinding\n\n* fix: keep external XMPP passwords server-side with BOSH prebinding\n\n* fix: merge Converse.js overrides without replacing existing overrides\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: stop accepting guest auth shared secret in URL query parameters\n\n* Fix ConverseJS lint and phpstan issues\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Harden storage access and validate Converse integration contracts\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Keep reaction picker from being clipped by the chat window\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Silence eslint no-console on new diagnostic logging\n\n* [DOC] XMPP: Address review feedback on Converse integration boundaries\n\n* [DOC] XMPP: Document Converse integration boundaries\n\n* [FIX] HeaderLib: Hash source files directly\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Generate Converse styles and fix asset paths\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Reset guest identity when ending support chat\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Improve chat destination dialog copy\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Improve fullscreen chat behavior and exit option\n\n* [ENH] XMPP: Make chat destination labels translatable through Tiki\n\n* Add translations to anonymous chat destination dialog\n\n* fix(xmpp): restrict profile actions for guest users\n\n* fix(xmpp): restore roster contacts and restrict guest profile actions\n\n* Remove some comments\n\n* fix(xmpp): harden MAM parsing and session restoration\n\n* fix(xmpp): sort chats by activity and improve MAM handling\n\n* Remove global node_modules ignore rule\n\n* Improve XMPP chat performance, presence status, fullscreen, and guest UX\n\n* fix(xmpp): improve fullscreen, guest routing, presence, and chat performance\n\n* fix(xmpp): fix stale view_mode cookie override and remove redundant fullscreen toggle\n\n* fix(xmpp): fix js_modules cache replay, fullscreen sidebar layout, and view mode switcher\n\n* fix(xmpp): fix embedded room scroll spilling into the pag\n\n* fix(xmpp): fix embedded view mode not rendering ConverseJS\n\n* fix(build): sync postcss override with vite''s requirement to unblock npm ci\n\n* fix(xmpp): fix Assistance last-seen persistence, offline message badges, and Smarty escape compatibility\n\n* fix(xmpp): remove guest-to-admin presence subscribe and fix Assistance status falsely showing Online from old restored messages\n\n* [FIX] HeaderLib: use Smarty\\Modifier\\Escape class instead of the unreliable smarty_modifier_escape() shim\n\n* fix(xmpp): add activity-based Assistance presence/last-seen, fix SMACKS desync, return-to-room link, and MUC nickname errors\n\n* fix(xmpp): disable OMEMO by default, fix message notifications and guest UX\n\n* fix(xmpp): prevent automatic chat popups and refine Community selector\n\n* Bump ConverseJS cache epoch for null chatboxes reset\n\n* fix(xmpp): improve popup layout and theme-aware controls\n\n* fix(xmpp): improve chat popup responsiveness and theme compatibility\n\n* fix(xmpp): center chat popup on mobile and tablet\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: remove stale comment in ChatBoxView.renderMessageForm\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: add working ''return to group chat'' link from Assistance DM\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: fix incomplete storage wipe, restore site-wide room auto-join, UI polish\n\n* [ENH] XMPP: fix external identity persistence, guest support history, and popup UX\n\n* [FIX] Illegal mix of collations (ascii_bin, utf8mb4_general_ci)\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Harden ConverseJS loading and guest chat state handling\n\n* [FIX] XMPP: Avoid MySQL 8.4 display width warnings\n\n* Add XMPP guest credentials to InnoDB conversion\n\n* Keep ConverseJS theme styles in base SCSS\n\n* Fix XMPP guest credentials schema checks\n\n* Fix ESLint no-console errors in XMPP plugins\n\n* Fix ESLint no-console errors in XMPP plugins\n\n* Sync XMPP MR with local ConverseJS updates\n\n* Align XMPP MR diff with ConverseJS 14 styling updates\n\n* Fix ConverseJS XMPP initialization and branding behavior\n\n* Show controlbox by default on dedicated XMPP pages\n\n* Fix XMPP ConverseJS initialization and controlbox handling\n\n* Clean up XMPP MR comments and restore scoped changes\n\n* Restore master comments and tighten XMPP JSON encoding\n\n* Remove unrelated tracker and facet changes from XMPP MR\n\n* Fix XMPP lint issues and restore removed behavior\n\n* Fix XMPP PHPCS formatting and camelCase method names\n\n* Clean up XMPP MR scope and comments\n\n* Update package lock for ConverseJS 14\n\n* Reduce popup\n\n(cherry picked from commit 70d3bdd93b83b59f3d252cf612b687f5f8a1b377)\n\n* Upgrade to ConverseJS 14\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9cb7257e283cfe7523212afb96b305d919b6a48c)\n\n* Correct popup ConverseJS\n\n(cherry picked from commit e1024da139ef97c4f5afd678aa079eab500632d2)\n\n* Fix Community popup\n\n(cherry picked from commit d71b28b9afe25fe6a066ef8adc83d588303a4476)\n\n* Auto login password jid externe + some style x converse logos\n\n(cherry picked from commit 1cd78393f87fad7398d1bcc7a75ce7be56ecd78e)\n\n* Fix JID management and animation in converse Chat\n\n(cherry picked from commit bb34fb9ce55aba1b03a769b2415898ce1dae75e5)\n\n* Fix 3 dots to work only on typing...\n\n(cherry picked from commit ddf9745d60ed45c4e7de1e2c28723a7f63034025)\n\n* Add Open Graph and correct send image pbm\n\n(cherry picked from commit 61b3077d2e8aa5697ae858c48af5615499b50bdd)\n\n* Fix audio and sefurl\n\n(cherry picked from commit 5d8483f15dc0d7f4e9a9f004d15db6e9b7cf0bd9)\n\n* Fix external jid and Community room\n\n(cherry picked from commit b93efec2a5898c4a01a09519d99a81cad3bc6129)\n\n* Recatoring by Claude fixing several issues\n\n(cherry picked from commit 01ec95dd3eb8cf882e4bd3da7a0b878aa739b5d3)\n\n* Style hidden button\n\n(cherry picked from commit b9e47a9d6aebf69e2e07dd72e1b8e2e1f2782c34)\n\n* popups only on page with xmpp plugin\n\n(cherry picked from commit 77de116cb221610cda2529553328c402df6268f3)\n\n* Correct the check button\n\n(cherry picked from commit ce2c226df4416dcedc33db8f5347d93be21c5a02)\n\n* Add Chat button\n\n(cherry picked from commit a694f71e3b86ea38adf1e429df6a524f111505e9)\n\n* Refactor ConverseJS\n\n(cherry picked from commit 8eefd71c228f2a3e18997c3c993eb6492ab02b9f)\n\n* Center name with image on Converse JS\n\n(cherry picked from commit f67e706db79a43d83a20b93badc0120e087bb46e)\n\n* Customize Converjs\n\n(cherry picked from commit 5d1c7dd4bbfb3ff74fac13a48b93976354ac4ccf)\n\n* Correct bugs\n\n(cherry picked from commit 261c259e427a338254213d2291d7a752df0fa538)\n\n* Support WebSocket endpoints for custom XMPP accounts\n\n(cherry picked from commit bad3afc994594cd264bf8cb5c242ce2f3b56437c)\n\n* Add defensive check before accessing queryResult[0][''trackerId'']\n\n* [FIX] FacetFilter: preserve raw facet option keys to fix selected facet loss\n\n* [FIX] search facets regression: keep raw submitted keys, preserve mapped labels\n\n* [FIX] search facets: preserve raw submitted values while keeping mapped labels\n\n* Fix regression introduced by 65011fee1f by preserving raw facet option keys for submission and using mapped values only for display.\n\n* [FIX] Faceted search: preserve selected facets on results page\n\nSee merge request tikiwiki/tiki!10988","tree":{"sha":"a04c0f0d7f94b20bec3acab71bfbcd664e9f27b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/trees/a04c0f0d7f94b20bec3acab71bfbcd664e9f27b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/git/commits/2f7ecb5375483eac6c70bb1310a6995ed66ca1c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commit/2f7ecb5375483eac6c70bb1310a6995ed66ca1c9","node_id":"C_kwDOO1SSh9oAKDJmN2VjYjUzNzU0ODNlYWM2YzcwYmIxMzEwYTY5OTVlZDY2Y2ExYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commit/0bab601f685c59472c13772527d3aa6513f68a65","sha":"0bab601f685c59472c13772527d3aa6513f68a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olivier-Kango/tiki/commits/0bab601f685c59472c13772527d3aa6513f68a65"}],"sha":"2f7ecb5375483eac6c70bb1310a6995ed66ca1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/O