"repositoryId":995405208,"sha":"3508b20f423a8511d7acb58ff8ed7e9738bc5b8d"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","providerType":"Bot"},"email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"authoredDate":"2026-05-19T18:31:59Z","committedDate":"2026-05-19T18:31:59Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T19:22:33.973Z","repositoryId":995405208,"sha":"8e5e28a598c1855cb70bbb575813a3a183176017"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T19:22:33.973Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152174275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HusneShabbir","id":152174275,"login":"HusneShabbir","node_id":"U_kgDOCRH-ww","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/d83943626b37b5767df4793a4da0407934c77f1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:35:40Z","email":"shabbirhusne447@gmail.com","name":"Husne Shabbir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:35:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(RHIDP-14570): add intent-based CLI unit gaps and e2e scaffold (#218)\n\n* test(RHIDP-14570): add intent-based CLI unit gaps and e2e scaffold\n\nFill search/api unit coverage, expand catalog/template command tests,\nand add help/error contract e2e that skips live RHDH unless configured.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(RHIDP-14570): resolve lint and trim redundant intent CLI tests\n\nUse describe.skip for optional live RHDH e2e to satisfy\njest/no-standalone-expect, collapse duplicated help/error and command\ncases to cut Sonar duplication, and keep unique failure coverage.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(RHIDP-14570): add mocked client integration for intent CLI\n\nExercise real commander/helpers/format paths with client mocked so\ncatalog/api/search/docs/template cover integration ACs without live\nRHDH. Slim overlapping unit happy-path tests to validation-only cases.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(RHIDP-14570): prettier integration tests and drop redundant api unit\n\nFormat intent-commands.integration.test.ts for CI prettier:check, fold\nmissing get-spec.definition coverage into the mocked integration suite,\nand remove the overlapping api.test.ts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(RHIDP-14570): cover instance flag, catalog mutate, docs list/get\n\nAddress review feedback: assert --instance forwarding, catalog\nvalidate/register/unregister action wiring, and docs list/get\ntechdocs-mcp-extras integration paths with a mocked client.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(RHIDP-14570): drop redundant instance and docs unit coverage\n\nFold --instance into existing catalog/search integration cases and remove\ndocs unit tests already covered by mocked client integration.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(RHIDP-14570): retrigger CI after plugin-new e2e flake\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(RHIDP-14570): address gashcrumb review on exit mocks and e2e\n\nStop process.exit / handleCommandError fallthrough, clean temp dirs,\nrestore docs search suggestion coverage, reuse shared e2e helpers, and\npass RHDH_CLI_E2E_INSTANCE through --instance for live checks.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: HusneShabbir <husneshabbir447@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"2002c68c4eacda092feaf99a07f1427f80b02a6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/2002c68c4eacda092feaf99a07f1427f80b02a6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/d83943626b37b5767df4793a4da0407934c77f1a","verification":{"payload":"tree 2002c68c4eacda092feaf99a07f1427f80b02a6b\nparent 55865f0491e849eca5b84249899f717f8e95d376\nauthor Husne Shabbir <shabbirhusne447@gmail.com> 1791459340 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791459340 -0400\n\ntest(RHIDP-14570): add intent-based CLI unit gaps and e2e scaffold (#218)\n\n* test(RHIDP-14570): add intent-based CLI unit gaps and e2e scaffold\n\nFill search/api unit coverage, expand catalog/template command tests,\nand add help/error contract e2e that skips live RHDH unless configured.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(RHIDP-14570): resolve lint and trim redundant intent CLI tests\n\nUse describe.skip for optional live RHDH e2e to satisfy\njest/no-standalone-expect, collapse duplicated help/error and command\ncases to cut Sonar duplication, and keep unique failure coverage.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(RHIDP-14570): add mocked client integration for intent CLI\n\nExercise real commander/helpers/format paths with client mocked so\ncatalog/api/search/docs/template cover integration ACs without live\nRHDH. Slim overlapping unit happy-path tests to validation-only cases.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(RHIDP-14570): prettier integration tests and drop redundant api unit\n\nForm