ivacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gashcrumb","id":351660,"login":"gashcrumb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTY2MA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/55865f0491e849eca5b84249899f717f8e95d376/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:03:35Z","email":"gashcrumb@gmail.com","name":"Stan Lewis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:03:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(plugin): add comprehensive dynamic plugin development guide (#232)\n\n* docs(plugin): add comprehensive dynamic plugin development guide\n\n- Add docs/Plugin-Development-CLI.md covering standalone scaffolding, local runtime testing, dependency auditing, upgrading, and dynamic export\n- Document plugin new template shapes, version pinning, and standalone harnesses\n- Document plugin check-versions (and versions:lint alias), 3-tier version mapping, audit statuses, and CI pipeline recipes\n- Document plugin upgrade (and versions:bump alias), dry-run mode, and lockfile synchronization\n- Document plugin dev Compose runtime lifecycle, automated config include, and watch mode\n- Document air-gapped/offline operations with local manifests and RHDH_OFFLINE\n- Update README.md with cross-links to the new guide and list all plugin development commands\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* docs(plugin): address fullsend review feedback on plugin development guide\n\n- Add --name option to plugin new syntax reference\n- Avoid hardcoding current GA version in --rhdh-version option description\n- Add missing 1.7.0 and 1.6.0 entries to static compatibility matrix table\n- Clarify Yarn lockfile detection behavior in lockfile synchronization section\n- Accurately describe stop --clean behavior preserving staged dynamic plugin artifacts\n- Correct container event types and clarify HTTP readiness polling in watch mode\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* docs(plugin): update plugin new options and dev progress labels\n\n- Document --manifest-file option for plugin new and air-gapped usage\n- Align dev start progress phase labels with CLI log output\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* docs(plugin): address reviewer feedback on plugin development guide\n\n- Clarify --rhdh-version fallback resolution when omitted\n- Document complementary roles of --manifest-file and RHDH_OFFLINE\n- Align dry-run preview sample with printUpgradeResult output\n- Restrict plugin new version examples and align supported types table\n- Clarify check-versions audit statuses, backstage:^ handling, and exit codes\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED","tree":{"sha":"d664997e26b9ffa3353a7a77616369a6e7015076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/d664997e26b9ffa3353a7a77616369a6e7015076"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/55