ps://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/a4c5da0cc119f393042721703d7f1ea6eaea3992/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:03:21Z","email":"gashcrumb@gmail.com","name":"Stan Lewis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:03:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(version-management): add e2e integration tests for plugin check-versions and upgrade (#231)\n\n* test(version-management): add e2e integration tests for plugin check-versions and upgrade\n\n- Add e2e-tests/plugin-version-management.test.ts verifying plugin check-versions and upgrade lifecycle\n- Test version mismatch detection, remediation output, and --json structured output\n- Test non-destructive --dry-run and --skip-install upgrade modes\n- Test full upgrade with package manager install and lockfile synchronization\n- Test multi-step version upgrade lifecycle across releases (1.8 -> 2.0 -> 2.1)\n- Test dynamic plugin export of an upgraded plugin fixture\n- Test offline and air-gapped auditing and upgrading via --manifest-file and RHDH_OFFLINE=true\n- Register versions:lint alias for check-versions in src/commands/index.ts\n- Enrich runCommand Error with stdout, stderr, code, and signal properties\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* test(e2e): deduplicate runExpectingFailure helper in support/plugin-export-build\n\n- Move runExpectingFailure into e2e-tests/support/plugin-export-build.ts\n- Share runExpectingFailure across plugin-dev.test.ts and plugin-version-management.test.ts\n- Resolve SonarCloud code duplication quality gate failure\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* fix(upgrade): allow lockfile mutation during install in CI environments\n\n- Disable immutable installs (YARN_ENABLE_IMMUTABLE_INSTALLS=false) during upgrade''s yarn install step\n- Allow Yarn Berry to update yarn.lock when running under CI=true or PR workflows\n- Pass YARN_ENABLE_IMMUTABLE_INSTALLS=false in e2e version management upgrade test\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* test(version-management): address review feedback on e2e test suite\n\n- Remove unused RunCommandOptions import in plugin-dev.test.ts\n- Restore test isolation with afterEach hook in dependency upgrading suite\n- Pin multi-step upgrade lifecycle tests to RHDH_OFFLINE=true\n- Add backstage.json to offline test fixture and assert version synchronization\n- Revert global YARN_ENABLE_IMMUTABLE_INSTALLS mutation in upgrade command\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* test(version-management): address reviewer feedback on e2e test suite\n\n- Verify lockfile synchronization in full upgrade test and restore baseline yarn.lock in afterEach\n- Provide local manifest fixtures for multi-step 1.8 -> 2.0 -> 2.1 lifecycle test and tighten 2.1 assertions\n- Test real plugin skew, upgrade with package manager install, and dynamic export supported-versions matching\n\nAssisted-By: opencode\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED","tree":{"sha":"facf25a9b35f1271126a8c57a0589e18a3d52513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/facf25a9b35f1271126a8c57a0589e18a3d52513"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r