i-coder[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:45:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(docs): add CLI UX design conventions to AGENTS.md (#207)\n\n* docs: add CLI UX design conventions to AGENTS.md\n\nAdd a new CLI UX Design Conventions section to AGENTS.md\nencoding the design principles established through PR #156\nreview. These conventions give the review agent concrete\npatterns to check when new intent-based commands are added:\n\n- Entity references: positional [kind:][namespace/]name\n  via parseEntityRef/resolveEntityRef in kv.ts\n- Filter/input flags: repeatable --flag key=value via\n  collect/resolveJsonInput, not JSON string arguments\n- Plugin dependencies: detect missing optional plugins\n  and exit with clear error, not raw HTTP responses\n- Exit codes: non-zero on not-found or failure via\n  handleCommandError from intent-errors.ts\n- Error presentation: use intent-errors.ts formatError\n  for structured {error, reason, suggestion} output\n- Help text: passthrough commands must surface the\n  underlying tools flags\n\nNote: prettier could not run (tooling not installed in\nsandbox). Manual verification of formatting is required.\n\nCloses #206\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\n* docs: update CLI examples to use positional entity refs\n\nReplace deprecated flag-based entity input patterns (--name, --entity-ref,\n--template-ref) with positional ref arguments in documentation examples,\naligning with the CLI UX design conventions added to AGENTS.md.\n\nUpdated examples in:\n- docs/Intent-Based-CLI.md (workflows 2, 3, 5, and agent workflow)\n- README.md (quick examples)\n\nNote: PR title fix (remove # from scope) could not be applied due to\nsandbox restrictions. Recommend renaming to:\n  docs: add CLI UX design conventions to AGENTS.md\n\nAddresses #207\n\nAssisted-by: claude-sonnet-4-6\n\n* docs: fix entity reference convention to cite resolveEntityWithAmbiguityCheck\n\nReplace incorrect reference to `resolveEntityRef` in `kv.ts` with\n`resolveEntityWithAmbiguityCheck` from `helpers.ts`, which is the\nfunction actually used by all command files (api.ts, catalog.ts,\ndocs.ts, template.ts) for entity resolution with catalog-based\nambiguity detection.\n\nAddresses #207\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-code <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"409bd9cd0d10c78d12657b639ca540b163c011c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/409bd9cd0d10c78d12657b639ca540b163c011c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/6f4b36623890f5357b7d30438185805e5e576e84","verification":{"payload":"tree 409bd9cd0d10c78d12657b639ca540b163c011c0\nparent 56149dc000c91881dd6af94fb86d033d8d12942b\nauthor fullsend-ai-coder[bot] <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790073912 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790073912 -0400\n\nfix(docs): add CLI UX design conventions to AGENTS.md (#207)\n\n* docs: add CLI UX design conventions to AGENTS.md\n\nAdd a new CLI UX Design Conventions section to AGENTS.md\nencoding the design principles established through PR #156\nreview. These conventions give the review agent concrete\npatterns to check when new intent-based commands are added:\n\n- Entity references: positional [kind:][namespace/]name\n  via parseEntityRef/resolveEntityRef in kv.ts\n- Filter/input flags: repeatable --flag key=value via\n  collect/resolveJsonInput, not JSON string arguments\n- Plugin dependencies: detect missing optional plugins\n  and exit with clear error, not raw HTTP responses\n- Exit codes: non-zero on not-found or failure via\n  handleCommandError from intent-errors.ts\n- Error presentation: use intent-errors.ts formatError\n  for structured {error, reason, suggestion} output\n- Help text: passthrough commands must surface the\n  underlying tools flags\n\nNote: prettier could not run (tooling not installed in\nsandbox). Manual verification of formatting is required.\n\nCloses #206\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\n* docs: update CLI examples to use positional entity refs\n\nReplace deprecated flag-based entity input patterns (--name, --entity-ref,\n--template-ref) with positional ref arguments in documentation examples,\naligning with the CLI UX design conventions added to AGENTS.md.\n\nUpdated examples in:\n- docs/Intent-Based-CLI.md (workflows 2, 3, 5, and agent workflow)\n- README.md (quick examples)\n\nNote: PR title fix (remove # from scope) could not be applied due to\nsandbox restrictions. Recommend renaming to:\n  docs: add CLI UX design conventions to AGENTS.md\n\nAddresses #207\n\nAssisted-by: claude-sonnet-4-6\n\n* docs: fix entity reference convention to cite resolveEntityWithAmbiguityCheck\n\nReplace incorrect reference to `resolveEntityRef` in `kv.ts` with\n`resolveEntityWithAmbiguityCheck` from `helpers.ts`, which is the\nfunction actually used by all command files (api.ts, catalog.ts,\ndocs.ts, template.ts) for entity resolution with catalog-based\nambiguity detection.\n\nAddresses #207\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-code <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqslw4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5WcQAIh33av/BnOpeRcLEaRjgwpE\nrmE3V4Wi34MQ8mLorfgRZQwgbqBltDQVfxBqAz8J+iKPioXqG2O1s+PPHa1vZDrZ\na1rkp2Ek/b3I0Ib9vFdm9xLvxuExOvT7pYyRbgELTNOu08pD/cMuNMtvx5wXoYSy\nPthWijdyRNY7cyZ2LozBEb4477HKoOykJlpZx4PTllUQ9Ki9ZMv3CIZSm9hI4yek\nXCSSEOPrhlT4R1t2SPDLjqwSYnkLvfMW/k3qZ5x+pRkReaPMJrRNGsqtwrZZ0szg\nr7c+BffIaBkMgiDtjxFG1OKBYlROtdwBNbTAIsufeLGKHEONOY1lp6AdtmyYYXs8\n7+tg2qkAI5nS8sJQkLZHoZUE8euAaKElZJjl+DfYHHlEmUQxE8S+UdPJ/3ZBYoXB\nPNt3Xem3UpvC8SV8gGqXtig+RG2Ycl7vD9ARaG7qEX11BR4cHIZaV0fOXFI6TxLx\niNnqcBQ0q8BxhrSzaYUIwzc0NeEshdiLA1sH1j8oCDvy88PIDe8aLJz7bPv9AnSd\n9KjvitHcijBlJ7cntzj4JNktwaPcQMiwTZoJLIATnvke6tGK3u6m9piRuE0FCKD2\n4FT4XA9Tem38HSS