enting that scopes must match [\\w$\\.\\-* ]* -- the\ncharacter class enforced by the headerPattern regex in\npr-semantic.yaml. This prevents agents and contributors\nfrom using # or other special characters in the scope\nposition, which causes PR Semantic CI failures requiring\nhuman intervention to rename the title.\n\nCloses #189\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-code <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cfa9f102ca9777528b699fdec342fb8b6cf818a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/3cfa9f102ca9777528b699fdec342fb8b6cf818a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/6c63db74a5d3f6366dcfa0fd1da4d19f86a5e2c8","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cfa9f102ca9777528b699fdec342fb8b6cf818a\nparent 9350f3a2045e2a02622ea55a23f8f7d87d1b68b0\nauthor fullsend-ai-coder[bot] <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1788957404 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788957404 -0400\n\ndocs(#189): document PR title scope character restrictions (#190)\n\nAdd a bullet to the PR Conventions section of AGENTS.md\ndocumenting that scopes must match [\\w$\\.\\-* ]* -- the\ncharacter class enforced by the headerPattern regex in\npr-semantic.yaml. This prevents agents and contributors\nfrom using # or other special characters in the scope\nposition, which causes PR Semantic CI failures requiring\nhuman intervention to rename the title.\n\nCloses #189\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-code <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoVLcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeMMQAD2yBpK+Fs6+3rLYcpAYcD2W\nIUZt44zOBi+U8ZH06RYFeFrG5/NQMQiKrYkaFEhYSHUQJKRBot1bF6X0J6CQ+WTc\nTUjxwZ9uXyxKKAa9U0JzJ1l5GDmwhLBADwLRuzu5E/DNsZBCvyPJrHnilYr5QtHQ\n9ARXtw0iO+rs2YrSpwn2Ap3Oi24UrWGUwUGIWxgeAB4wniyUzT0v9+17jOSNCV1C\nUz4NULzGxKygGhGwoUq1YM5slLUne2RKM34hDX/Uc3a