nts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/cb1efdbaf9d6188d148c463ecd47939cde4a02b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:14:58Z","email":"278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"fullsend-ai-coder[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:14:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(#187): pin review harness model to available Vertex AI version (#188)\n\nThe model: sonnet alias in the review harness config resolved to\nclaude-sonnet-4-6, which is not provisioned on the repo''s GCP\nVertex AI endpoint. This caused all review runs to fail immediately\nwith zero tokens used since PR #181 merged.\n\nPin the model to claude-sonnet-4-5@20250929, which the error\nmessage in run 34327800934 confirmed is available on the deployment.\nUsing an explicit version avoids future breakage if the sonnet\nalias advances again before the deployment is updated.\n\nNote: yarn lint:check and yarn prettier:check could not run\n(yarn not available in sandbox). The change is a single-line YAML\nconfig update that is not covered by ESLint or Prettier.\n\nCloses #187\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-code <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba129c5f639796c3f3ac50e31ba16290e5a0fac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/ba129c5f639796c3f3ac50e31ba16290e5a0fac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/cb1efdbaf9d6188d148c463ecd47939cde4a02b9","verification":{"payload":"tree ba129c5f639796c3f3ac50e31ba16290e5a0fac3\nparent 521a2974ef02cbe741f81540bbf71d3095fc4342\nauthor fullsend-ai-coder[bot] <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1788948898 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788948898 -0400\n\nfix(#187): pin review harness model to available Vertex AI version (#188)\n\nThe model: sonnet alias in the review harness config resolved to\nclaude-sonnet-4-6, which is not provisioned on the repo''s GCP\nVertex AI endpoint. This caused all review runs to fail immediately\nwith zero tokens used since PR #181 merged.\n\nPin the model to claude-sonnet-4-5@20250929, which the error\nmessage in run 34327800934 confirmed is available on the deployment.\nUsing an explicit version avoids future breakage if the sonnet\nalias advances again before the deployment is updated.\n\nNote: yarn lint:check and yarn prettier:check could not run\n(yarn not available in sandbox). The change is a single-line YAML\nconfig update that is not covered by ESLint or Prettier.\n\nCloses #187\n\nAssisted-by: claude-opus-4-6\n\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-code <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoTGiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhQEQAJcMWCAxztmgJDaq+tEl5+hF\nsxAWlF5Okde4U8EEIuwShZJ3bFsHxwUGeHL02EswZDG9ebvW8Y1fV+DdcMCft91T\nzQd1vgLPNdwarDEF1iAc6r3fLub8mQNgBcFHlGVq7+UZQBbm1DtQo7L2vdvZd3Og\nyt0maAN0LBeyP17wZE+7aoTCumV0mK2fvwPwLBf1fZcbVKl4nO0ALbdV9BRW2EeW\nBrr6xFhfafx3ybGT1D/YBH/jGO4OJXyttjXw8pc3S8bQOr9GoNjZgA1JAkL6qciN\nSPnA41vTEy2WtR2yPViLgTIwjqe6gkDFb2/2UQVFEnMNnzGCrgXgCM9uau4DBiDa\ndu0vX7g29FN2W9kaq10Po6IHoi4ECxL1qHTiyvR06UKe0tkEMrRTmh06i2Q6aOsr\nSK2pfT6jY+XMHdHNCi1hZh1WsxAjTOcps8fVQVFnUvafbr56vLoVXQP1VFPxFgcI\nFE4swxxGaQt4mOmUNuenhoTUNEouaC8jhkBi6E8khvoFP4YXi2og/psabU8yvgsW\nSHfzpvYzBVh4jg+18wQmfFC49G5JeZ69J7JA2ATCq7T8k/bwtFXAfml53caaeW8F\n/6lZ4OvTg6MoKWwEZyxDloioAIbcrZ3/KOlcw+25qkQ2++FyZ+bqhpTF+Kh668Br\nIdc0zjOaREsmtZjCN2Wi\n=oHlk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T10:14:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api