17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/e50301af6241717b713734eca8eef9d50efa5317"}],"sha":"0229ca3cf8b7ad2b382daabc930a27e481e0b32f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/0229ca3cf8b7ad2b382daabc930a27e481e0b32f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/351660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gashcrumb","id":351660,"login":"gashcrumb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTY2MA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/e50301af6241717b713734eca8eef9d50efa5317/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T10:08:04Z","email":"gashcrumb@gmail.com","name":"Stan Lewis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T10:08:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve plugin package exit codes and npm pack path length issues (RHDHBUGS-3556) (#169)\n\n* fix: re-throw errors in plugin package command to ensure proper exit codes\n\nThe catch block in the package-dynamic-plugins command was swallowing\nerrors after logging them, causing the CLI to exit with code 0 even\nwhen packaging failed. This meant that wrapper scripts (like\nexport-dynamic.sh) couldn''t detect failures and would attempt to push\nnon-existent container images.\n\nNow the error is re-thrown after logging, ensuring the CLI exits with\na non-zero code and failures are properly propagated.\n\nFixes: RHDHBUGS-3556\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* fix: work around npm pack failures with long paths\n\nnpm pack can fail with an internal error when the current working\ndirectory path is very long. This was observed with the\nsearch-backend-module-github-discussions plugin in community-plugins.\n\nTo avoid this issue, copy the dist-dynamic contents to a temporary\ndirectory with a shorter path (under packScratchParent) before running\nnpm pack, then run npm pack from that shorter path.\n\nThe temp directory is cleaned up in the finally block.\n\nFixes: RHDHBUGS-3556\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* chore: bump version to 2.0.3\n\nRelease includes fixes for RHDHBUGS-3556:\n- Exit code propagation in plugin package command\n- npm pack path length workaround\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* style: fix prettier formatting\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED","tree":{"sha":"938d0edac58780a9d0476a215364c16f95cf31a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/938d0edac58780a9d0476a215364c16f95cf31a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/e50301af6241717b713734eca8eef9d50efa5317","verification":{"payload":"tree 938d0edac58780a9d0476a215364c16f95cf31a4\nparent 847f13b8fe14c7aa9f4dda0fd1c7522a0c8459fc\nauthor Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com> 1787738884 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787738884 -0400\n\nfix: resolve plugin package exit codes and npm pack path length issues (RHDHBUGS-3556) (#169)\n\n* fix: re-throw errors in plugin package command to ensure proper exit codes\n\nThe catch block in the package-dynamic-plugins command was swallowing\nerrors after logging them, causing the CLI to exit with code 0 even\nwhen packaging failed. This meant that wrapper scripts (like\nexport-dynamic.sh) couldn''t detect failures and would attempt to push\nnon-existent container images.\n\nNow the error is re-thrown after logging, ensuring the CLI exits with\na non-zero code and failures are properly propagated.\n\nFixes: RHDHBUGS-3556\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* fix: work around npm pack failures with long paths\n\nnpm pack can fail with an internal error when the current working\ndirectory path is very long. This was observed with the\nsearch-backend-module-github-discussions plugin in community-plugins.\n\nTo avoid this issue, copy the dist-dynamic contents to a temporary\ndirectory with a shorter path (under packScratchParent) before running\nnpm pack, then run npm pack from that shorter path.\n\nThe temp directory is cleaned up in the finally block.\n\nFixes: RHDHBUGS-3556\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* chore: bump version to 2.0.3\n\nRelease includes fixes for RHDHBUGS-3556:\n- Exit code propagation in plugin package command\n- npm pack path length workaround\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* style: fix prettier formatting\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5)\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjrsECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeSMQACo+3LQqJ3x3ZmvpDy68I6mY\nJacJnT4f4i2aCWnPafg5BheqzJIHow4NAGbNOMgyIsgPcdvn/nldA6ppHYopJeW9\nGE1RHEyUbNlUhUIbMU8XJoYl+qldhfNG2HJC54EIrpb1B11pemvZX95jcPteordl\nUmEACWrN0aH+tAFba9B95CKzMFhgoWuCe+uUyPUk1lswMbtUYG5vsyW2WRTWLC7Z\npNhZYdQgzqnb+hMkQeGHxruozXyBnSVVhXGUaVmESRXjFLaCFXxDficSI0S7GX+2\nPvYvwBB1KI2PGNbT7b0tyPY+JnJ0a/71PY0isjPG9AVVScqO2Dn7NHTqWm6m79fY\n2vxDuImANCf+43AUNl6V+QrEZrY8Ti6lisrw4N+bt3/RCPe4IoX6nn5JiJO8Cc2u\nPKdm7JK0if/X2+9EugQFFsrvTBMFW1S4G93YHE7DCkrZgMIGgAnGHZdL2Q65JK5w\nLoVHmd1ys/w1bfH8SYnrbiNKgvpKxI0a3uM33tID/LAmXpaR13+gMqdrzVfBdFgc\nwxr0xChdlgrC0S5UHqHz5oCiakhP6gqu3f+LT294ZXc85/v25U0ceV5q46J0Gkea\nYw3CY17wQVfGdLM3yN+eyR/fprNvbCJBRS60aMWNSvP4K92WW92yvUSIW6ztW0F5\nkTaCpKls6g4SniMNu6bs\n=0Drj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T10:08:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commit/e50301af6241717b713734eca8eef9d50efa5317","node_id":"C_kwDOO1StmNoAKGU1MDMwMWFmNjI0MTcxN2I3MTM3MzRlY2E4ZWVmOWQ1MGVmYTUzMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commit/847f13b8fe14c7aa9f4dda0fd1c7522a0c8459fc","sha":"847f13b8fe14c7aa9f4dda0fd1c7522a0c8459fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/847f13b8fe14c7aa9f4dda0fd1c7522a0c8459fc"}],"sha":"e50301af6241717b713734eca8eef9d50efa5317","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/e50301af6241717b713734eca8eef9d50efa5317"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/351660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gashcrumb","id":351660,"login":"gashcrumb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTY2MA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/847f13b8fe14c7aa9f4dda0fd1c7522a0c8459fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:24:50Z","email":"gashcrumb@gmail.com","name":"Stan Lewis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:24:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: prevent OCI images with empty plugin metadata (RHDHBUGS-3633) (#168)\n\nPrevent publishing OCI images with empty io.backstage.dynamic-packages\nannotation when all plugin exports fail. The plugin package command now:\n\n- Tracks which plugins successfully export by verifying dist-dynamic exists\n- Only packages plugins that successfully exported\n- Validates that at least one plugin was packaged before building container\n- Fails with a clear error message if all exports failed\n\nPreviously, if all plugin exports failed, the command would still create and\npublish an OCI image with an empty annotation ([] encoded as base64 W10=),\ncausing RHDH''s install-dynamic-plugins to silently register nothing.\n\nThis fix prevents the two known broken artifacts:\n- backstage-community-plugin-servicenow-backend:bs_1.52.0__1.13.1\n- backstage-community-plugin-search-backend-module-github-discussions:bs_1.52.0__0.14.0\n\nChanges:\n- Track successful exports in a Set during export phase\n- Filter packages list to only include successful exports during packaging\n- Add existence check for dist-dynamic/package.json before reading\n- Validate pluginRegistryMetadata.length > 0 before container build\n- Add comprehensive unit tests for all validation scenarios\n- Bump version from 2.0.1 to 2.0.2\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.5 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5@20250929)\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED","tree":{"sha":"67998abd4c35097793895433d1a1674df20c8895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/67998abd4c35097793895433d1a1674df20c8895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/847f13b8fe14c7aa9f4dda0fd1c7522a0c8459fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 67998abd4c35097793895433d1a1674df20c8895\nparent 487b0bec347b44bd1c1565696bc58acc91fb52ce\nauthor Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com> 1787642690 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787642690 +0200\n\nfix: prevent OCI images with empty plugin metadata (RHDHBUGS-3633) (#168)\n\nPrevent publishing OCI images with empty io.backstage.dynamic-packages\nannotation when all plugin exports fail. The plugin package command now:\n\n- Tracks which plugins successfully export by verifying dist-dynamic exists\n- Only packages plugins that successfully exported\n- Validates that at least one plugin was packaged before building container\n- Fails with a clear error message if all exports failed\n\nPreviously, if all plugin exports failed, the command would still create and\npublish an OCI image with an empty annotation ([] encoded as base64 W10=),\ncausing RHDH''s install-dynamic-plugins to silently register nothing.\n\nThis fix prevents the two known broken artifacts:\n- backstage-community-plugin-servicenow-backend:bs_1.52.0__1.13.1\n- backstage-community-plugin-search-backend-module-github-discussions:bs_1.52.0__0.14.0\n\nChanges:\n- Track successful exports in a Set during export phase\n- Filter packages list to only include successful exports during packaging\n- Add existence check for dist-dynamic/package.json before reading\n- Validate pluginRegistryMetadata.length > 0 before container build\n- Add comprehensive unit tests for all validation scenarios\n- Bump version from 2.0.1 to 2.0.2\n\nAssisted-by: Claude 3.5 Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5@20250929)\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjUNCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYrQQAGtkFFqsqHeznuJLbbeQ/78G\nOShqOqtUmm+4HCvYiXp9uS2yrdP1/1XMCd2I+Zn6SQ41ZmJWw/iG+SkMDLawH6BO\n0z5KBJpapJ29s95ikIos5gFBTl6x9OGlUTKByrogjLXeVbGqlP61TXhJSqnR5XG9\nRhVnCcdZfN5FeqXTNBnWDwvLlZnLf05SPfzDz0ZHTLWXJhezWbBtke5DMXd4E4OC\nj2utA8tN1ZmUzjHTu72jGVNFWQtgamyYwGY26uF3x/aCQ6VjlqgRj+8+MHPK+Nks\n3JMpVDmtwNWJBualiHhOfb+RBrpDhRq59yP/zU/885QBh85keW2S59qSRsl8G8+m\nLCF2RMC3Eu4Bkd9C6ZeEC5KDZIXsrc1CYuRAxHIrMUpck13lDox2VXs0dN5AmMBk\n8sFnyODMDpLgWNNdZNqPxBlIt+l34Ved2GhdHsW8Mzjz+mAG/Zr/y/nmgQJ/ILxI\ne3JbEpoRqeKP7645IEI8C+/ekR459EZsb+WULUw/Ftn1gC0D75EctJWLJdkXtGhZ\nyLchS9g9V3OkUhKJYd0APV/SBU+lcqyToucWStQcAIivRMsTTLSemcJHixAWOz0o\ni79Xc8ayQfY+ydIlMUB+pu6jQZdH89y+sH73LKA9qHvMNeyHgl86sWIf2855aXZ0\nXaJLoVIcdGsThrvcOkIE\n=CR8X\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08