github.com/christoph-jerolimov","id":139310,"login":"christoph-jerolimov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTMxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christoph-jerolimov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christoph-jerolimov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christoph-jerolimov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christoph-jerolimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christoph-jerolimov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christoph-jerolimov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/commits/caaf12d7e97e4813154f848a38486254feec3570/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:13:02Z","email":"jerolimov+git@redhat.com","name":"Christoph Jerolimov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:13:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ci): update publish workflow actions and remove npm upgrade step (#142)\n\n* ci: update publish workflow actions and remove npm upgrade step\n\nUpdate checkout and setup-node actions to v7. Remove fetch-depth\nand the separate npm upgrade step which is no longer needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): pin npm@11 for OIDC trusted publishing support\n\nnpm@latest now resolves to npm 12 which requires Node >= 22.22.2,\nbreaking CI on runners with Node 22.22.0. Pin to npm@11 which\nsupports OIDC (11.5.1+) and works with Node 20.17+ / 22.9+.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\n* fix(ci): restore .nvmrc deleted by mistake\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\n* fix(ci): use .nvmrc for node version across all workflows\n\nSingle source of truth for the Node version instead of\nhardcoding it in each workflow.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tomas Kral <git@tomaskral.eu>","tree":{"sha":"c228c64ac62fbe96d79e45e9b2b392a9766b69c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/trees/c228c64ac62fbe96d79e45e9b2b392a9766b69c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-cli/git/commits/caaf12d7e97e4813154f848a38486254feec3570","verification":{"payload":"tree c228c64ac62fbe96d79e45e9b2b392a9766b69c1\nparent 95774d0ba0f2d5fe0ed9d77b97f11e42570871f1\nauthor Christoph Jerolimov <jerolimov+git@redhat.com> 1784290382 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784290382 +0200\n\nchore(ci): update publish workflow actions and remove npm upgrade step (#142)\n\n* ci: update publish workflow actions and remove npm upgrade step\n\nUpdate checkout and setup-node actions to v7. Remove fetch-depth\nand the separate npm upgrade step which is no longer needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): pin npm@11 for OIDC trusted publishing support\n\nnpm@latest now resolves to npm 12 which requires Node >= 22.22.2,\nbreaking CI on runners with Node 22.22.0. Pin to npm@11 which\nsupports OIDC (11.5.1+) and works with Node 20.17+ / 22.9+.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\n* fix(ci): restore .nvmrc deleted by mistake\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\n* fix(ci): use .nvmrc for node version across all workflows\n\nSingle source of truth for the Node version instead of\nhardcoding it in each workflow.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tomas Kral <git@tomaskral.eu>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWhxOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAInAQAESVmzAlrBMISoi+g6mI8tH8\nGwrFRr+7oDCjDYYD8uLxSOgmMlyE1lJY/epKMUu8QpemMINvJoE09H99LtaHd6h/\npilK39CfA0wt+o9FauyiKaGFb6pO4EXebRWe5FhdFGdKblZF0GR9/ZVjo8Q2GVvx\nLMUZQSZNhmuleZTnv3i4nMdW40XTLZgAsLLF3K6yRrCIyCtJ0NRxhAxLCtao23du\nnA20JuU36S6toa0hPudhZxVYB2WptigvxDQdsS7f5P6uiOtoyovNdCevxwk/92g5\ny2TEh3Gwmy8JcTyV+wjG70ZD4dSx